<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Kɔnti Tife</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isirayila xa Kɔnti Tife</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kɔnti tife</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kɔn</para>
  <para style="mt">Tawureta Munsa</para>
  <para style="mt">Isirayila xa Kɔnti Tife</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Munsa xa kitaabui naani nde kui, Isirayila ɲama xa taruxui nde masenxi naa naxan tide gbo danxaniyatɔɛ birin bɛ. Alatala nu bara Isirayila ramini Misira konyiya kui sigafe ra Kanaan bɔxi ma, a dɛnnaxɛ laayidixi e benbae bɛ. Na sigɛ kui a nu lanma e xa gbengberenyi igiri. E to Turusinina geya li, Alatala naxa mini ɲama ma alako e xa gaaxu a ya ra, e man xa a xa sɛriyɛ kolon.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɔnɔ na dangi xanbi, Isirayila naxa tagan na ɲɛrɛ ma, Ala naxa e xɔnɔ xui mɛ. Ala nu fe birin nabama alako e xa a kolon a na mɛɛnife e ma biyaasi kui, kɔnɔ e mu wasa na ra. E to makɔrɛ Kanaan bɔxi ra, Ala naxa mixie sugandi e ya ma naxee siga naa rabɛnde. Nee xa dɛntɛgɛ naxa a niya Isirayila xa kɔntɔfili a ɲaaxi ra, e fa tondi sigade na bɔxi suxude.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na kui Alatala naxa natɛ tongo na mixie xili ma, naxee minixi Misira bɔxi ma, a e sese mu nu nɔma Kanaan bɔxi masɔtɔde fa, fo e xa die. Isirayila ɲama naxa ɲɛ tongo naani raba gbengberenyi ma, alako forie birin xa faxa, e xa die xa mɔ na biyaasi kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">A raɲɔnyi, e naxa makɔrɛ Kanaan naaninyi ra. Mowabakae mu tin e xa so, kɔnɔ Ala naxa a masen a fiixɛ ra a sese mu nɔma a niyade a xa a xa ɲama Isirayila rabɛɲin. Hali e to bara nu yunubi sɔtɔ, Ala e ɲaxankataxi naxan ma fe ra, a mu danyi sa a xa hinnɛ ma e bɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛriyɛ nan na ki danxaniyatɔɛ birin bɛ. Yunubi mu fan, a Ala raxɔnɔma. Won na gbilen Ala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, won xa a kolon na mu findima fe fanyi ra won bɛ. Kɔnɔ Ala yuge na ki naxɛ, hali a yunubitɔɛ ɲaxankata a xa yunubie xa fe ra, a man katɛ birin nabama alako a xa tin a xa hinnɛ ra naxan nɔma findide kisi ra a bɛ abadan. Ala tinxin, a xa kiiti mu kanama. Kɔnɔ a xa xanunteya gbo dangi fe birin na. A wama ibunadama birin xa lu a xa ɲama ya ma, e fa so ariyanna. Ala xa na raba won birin bɛ. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Tawureta Munsa</para>
  <para style="imte">Isirayila xa Kɔnti Tife</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xɛmɛe kɔnti tife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Isirayilakae xa mini Misira ɲɛ firin nde, kike firin nde, xi singe, Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ Turusinina gbengberenyi ma hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />«Wo xa Isirayila xɛmɛ birin kɔnti a xabilɛ nun a denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nɔma findide Isirayila sɔɔrie ra. I nun Haruna, wo xa e itaxun sɔɔri gaali ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Bɔnsɔɛ xunyie xa wo mali na wali kui. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />E xilie nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:5">Ruben bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Sedeyuri xa di xɛmɛ Elisuru.<verse eid="NUM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Surisadayi xa di xɛmɛ Selumiyeli.<verse eid="NUM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Aminadabo xa di xɛmɛ Naxason.<verse eid="NUM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Isakari bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Suwara xa di xɛmɛ Netaneeli.<verse eid="NUM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Xelon xa di xɛmɛ Eliyabi.<verse eid="NUM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Yusufu xa di xɛmɛ Efirami bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Amixudi xa di xɛmɛ Elisama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:10">Yusufu xa di xɛmɛ Manasi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Pedasuru xa di xɛmɛ Gamaliyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Gideyoni xa di xɛmɛ Abidan.<verse eid="NUM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Dana bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Amisadayi xa di xɛmɛ Axiyeseri.<verse eid="NUM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Aseri bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Okiran xa di xɛmɛ Pagiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Gadi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Duweli xa di xɛmɛ Eliyasafa.<verse eid="NUM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, Enan xa di xɛmɛ Axira.»<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Na bɔnsɔɛ xunyie nan xilixi, e xa findi Isirayila sɔɔri mangɛe ra. <verse eid="NUM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />E naxa kafu Munsa nun Haruna ma, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />e xa Isirayila ɲama malan, na kike firin nde, xi singe. Xɛmɛ birin naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, e naxa e tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ. Munsa naxa e tɛngɛ Turusinina gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />E naxa Isirayila xa di singe Ruben bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo naani nun senni, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />E naxa Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo suuli nun solomanaani, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ saxan nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />E naxa Gadi bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo naani nun suuli, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ senni tongo suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />E naxa Yuda bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo solofere nun naani, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ senni nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />E naxa Isakari bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo suuli nun naani, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ naani nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />E naxa Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo suuli nun solofere, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ naani nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />E naxa Yusufu xa di xɛmɛ Efirami bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo naani, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />E naxa Yusufu xa di xɛmɛ Manasi bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo saxan nun firin, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ firin nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />E naxa Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo saxan nun suuli, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ naani nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />E naxa Dana bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo senni nun firin, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ solofere nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />E naxa Aseri bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu naani nun keren, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />E naxa Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ birin tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma. E naxa xɛmɛe xili sɛbɛ, naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Na xasabi lan nɛ xɛmɛ wulu tongo suuli nun saxan, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ naani nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xunyi fu nun firinyi nan kafu Munsa nun Haruna ma na tɛngɛ tife ra. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Isirayila xɛmɛ naxee nu bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn li, naxee nu nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade, <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />nee nu lanxi xɛmɛ wulu kɛmɛ senni nun saxan, xɛmɛ kɛmɛ suuli nun tongo suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Kɔnɔ Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mu nu na na kɔnti ya ma, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />barima Alatala nu bara a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />«I naxa Lewikae tɛngɛ Isirayilakae ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />I xa hɔrɔmɔlingira nun a xa se birin taxu e ra. N ma saatɛ tɔnxuma na a ra. E xa a maxanin, e xa mɛɛni a ma, e xa yonkin a rabilinyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Wo na keli sigade, e xa a ragoro. Wo na yire nɛɛnɛ li, e xa a ti. Xa mixi gbɛtɛ a maso a ra naxan mu findi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ra, na kanyi lan nɛ a xa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Isirayilaka birin xa yonkin yire e na dɛnnaxɛ masen e bɛ, e bɔnsɔɛ xa tɔnxuma bun ma, a nun e xa sɔɔrie. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛe xa yonkin hɔrɔmɔlingira rabilinyi, xa na mu a ra n xɔnɔma nɛ Isirayila ɲama ma. Lewikae xa e ɲɛngi sa hɔrɔmɔlingira xɔn ma.»<verse eid="NUM 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Isirayilakae naxa Alatala xa yaamari birin suxu, a naxan soxi Munsa yi ra.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Bɔnsɔɛe dɔxɔ ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa nun Haruna bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />«Isirayilaka birin yonkinma e xabilɛ xa tɔnxuma nan bun ma. E birin ya rafindima e booree nan ma, hɔrɔmɔlingira fa lu e tagi.»<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma sogetede mabiri e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Aminadabo xa di Naxason nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo solofere nun naani, mixi kɛmɛ senni nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Isakari bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Yuda bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Suwara xa di Netaneeli nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo suuli nun naani, mixi kɛmɛ naani nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Yuda bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Xelon xa di Eliyabi nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo suuli nun solofere, mixi kɛmɛ naani nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Gali naxan yonkin Yuda bɔnsɔɛ mabiri, e xasabi lan mixi wulu kɛmɛ mixi wulu tongo solomasaxan nun senni, mixi kɛmɛ naani nan ma. E tan nan tima yare ra.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma sogetede mabiri e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Sedeyuri xa di Elisuru nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo naani nun senni, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Ruben bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Surisadayi xa di Selumiyeli nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo suuli nun solomanaani, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Ruben bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Duweli xa di Eliyasafa nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo naani nun suuli, mixi kɛmɛ senni nun tongo suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Gali naxan yonkin Ruben bɔnsɔɛ mabiri, e xasabi lan mixi wulu kɛmɛ mixi wulu tongo suuli nun keren, mixi kɛmɛ naani nun tongo suuli nan ma. E tan nan sigama a firin nde.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ naxan yonkinma e tagi, a birama e fɔxɔ ra hɔrɔmɔlingira xaninfe ra. Bɔnsɔɛ birin ɲɛrɛma e safɛ ki nan ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma sogegorode mabiri e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Amixudi xa di Elisama nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo naani, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Efirami bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Pedasuru xa di Gamaliyɛli nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo saxan nun firin, mixi kɛmɛ firin nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Efirami bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Gideyoni xa di Abidan nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo saxan nun suuli, mixi kɛmɛ naani nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Gali naxan yonkin Efirami bɔnsɔɛ mabiri, e xasabi lan mixi wulu kɛmɛ mixi wulu solomasaxan, mixi kɛmɛ nan ma. E tan nan sigama a saxan nde.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Dana bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma yirefanyi mabiri e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Amisadayi xa di Axiyeseri nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo senni nun firin, mixi kɛmɛ solofere nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Aseri bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Dana bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Okiran xa di Pagiyɛli nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo naani nun keren, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ nan yonkinma Dana bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma e xa tɔnxuma bun ma. Enan xa di Axira nan e xa yarerati ra. <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />A xa sɔɔrie xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo suuli nun saxan, mixi kɛmɛ naani nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Gali naxan yonkin Dana bɔnsɔɛ mabiri, e xasabi lan mixi wulu kɛmɛ mixi wulu tongo suuli nun solofere, mixi kɛmɛ senni nan ma. E tan nan sigama a dɔnxɔɛ ra e xa tɔnxumae bun ma.<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Isirayilaka naxee tɛngɛ e xabilɛ ki ma nun e xa sɔɔri gali ki ma, e xasabi lan mixi wulu kɛmɛ senni nun saxan, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nun tongo suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tan mu tɛngɛ Isirayilakae xun ma, alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ Munsa bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Isirayilakae naxa bira Alatala xa yaamari birin fɔxɔ ra, alɔ a Munsa yamari a ra ki naxɛ. E nu yonkinma e xa tɔnxuma nan bun ma, e man nu ɲɛrɛma e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Haruna nun Munsa xa taruxui nan ya, Alatala to wɔyɛn Munsa bɛ Turusinina geya ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Haruna xa di xɛmɛe xilie nan yi ki: a xa di xɛmɛ singe nu xili nɛ Nadabo, a xunyae, Abihu, Eleyasari, nun Itamari. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Nee nan sugandixi e xa findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Kɔnɔ Nadabo nun Abihu naxa faxa Alatala ya i e to sɛrɛxɛ gan tɛ ra naxan mu lanxi. E mu di yo sɔtɔ, kɔnɔ Eleyasari nun Itamari naxa lu sɛrɛxɛdubɛɲa kui e baba Haruna xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />«I xa Lewi bɔnsɔɛ masen Haruna bɛ, e xa a mali a xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ wali kui. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />E xa Haruna nun Isirayila ɲama mali hɔrɔmɔlingira wali kui. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />E xa e ɲɔxɔ sa hɔrɔmɔlingira raxunmasee xɔn na, e man xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali raba Isirayilakae bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Na kui i Lewi bɔnsɔɛ sama Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛe nan sago. E sugandixi Isirayilakae ya ma Haruna malife nan na. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />I xa Haruna nun a xa die nan tun ti sɛrɛxɛdubɛ wali rabafe ra. Xa mixi gbɛtɛ sa a maso hɔrɔmɔlingira ra, na kanyi xa faxa.»<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />«N bara Lewi bɔnsɔɛ sugandi Isirayilakae tagi Isirayila ginɛe xa di singe birin ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Na bɔnsɔɛ findixi n gbe nan na, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />barima n gbe nan na di xɛmɛ singe birin na. N to di xɛmɛ singe birin faxa Misira bɔxi ma, n naxa Isirayila di xɛmɛ singe birin sugandi n yɛtɛ bɛ, a findi mixi ra, a findi xuruse ra. N tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tɛngɛfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ Turusinina gbengberenyi ma, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />«Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tɛngɛ a denbaya nun a xabilɛ ki ma. Xɛmɛ birin tɛngɛma nɛ naxan ma simaya bara kike keren li.» <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Munsa naxa e tɛngɛ alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Lewi xa di xɛmɛe xilie nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 3:17">Gerison, Kehati, nun Merari.<verse eid="NUM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Gerison xa di xɛmɛe xilie nan yi ki a xabilɛ ki ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 3:18">Libini nun Simeyi.<verse eid="NUM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Kehati xa di xɛmɛe a xabilɛ ki ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 3:19">Amarama, Yisehari, Xebiron nun Yusiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Merari xa di xɛmɛe a xabilɛ ki ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 3:20">Maxali nun Musi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 3:20">Lewi xabilɛ nan na ki e xa denbaya ki ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Gerison bɔnsɔɛ nu na Libini Simeyi xabilɛ nan na. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Naxee xa simaya nu bara kike keren li, e xasabi lan mixi wulu solofere mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Gerison xabilɛ nu yonkinma hɔrɔmɔlingira nan xanbi ra sogegorode mabiri ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />E xunyi nu na Layɛli xa di xɛmɛ Eliyasafa nan na. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Gerison xa mixie nu e ɲɔxɔɛ saxi hɔrɔmɔlingira nan xɔn ma, nun mafelenyi naxan felenma a xun ma, a nun a sode dɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />a nun kɔlimɛ naxee nu sama hɔrɔmɔlingira nun sɛrɛxɛbade rabilinyi ma, a nun na tɛtɛ sode dɛ ra, a nun luutie e na maxirima naxee ra.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Kehati xa mixie nan yi ki: Amarama xabilɛ, Yisehari xabilɛ, Xebiron xabilɛ, nun Yusiyɛli xabilɛ. Na xabilɛe nan minixi e benba Kehati ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />E xa di xɛmɛ naxee xa simaya nu bara kike keren li, e xasabi lan mixi wulu solomasaxan kɛmɛ senni nan ma. Kehati xa mixie nan nu mɛɛnima hɔrɔmɔlingira ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />E tan nu yonkinma hɔrɔmɔlingira yirefanyi mabiri nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Yusiyɛli xa di xɛmɛ Elisafan nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Hɔrɔmɔlingira saatɛ kankira, teebili, lanpuie, sɛrɛxɛbadee, yirabase naxee rawalima yire sɛniyɛnxi kui, nun dugi yarasa naxan na hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, e nu taxuxi e tan nan na. <verse eid="NUM 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ birin xunyi nu na Haruna xa di xɛmɛ Eleyasari nan na. A tan nan nu Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie xun ma, naxee mɛɛnima hɔrɔmɔlingira ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Merari xa mixie nan yi ki: Maxali xabilɛ nun Musi xabilɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />E xa di xɛmɛ naxee xa simaya nu bara kike keren li, e xasabi lan mixi wulu senni kɛmɛ firin nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Abixayili xa di xɛmɛ Suriyeli nan nu na Merari xabilɛe xunyi ra. E nu yonkinma hɔrɔmɔlingira kɔɔla mabiri nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Hɔrɔmɔlingira xebenyie, a wuri kuyee, a kɔntigibae, a sanbunyie, a xa yirabase, nun a rawalisee nu taxuxi e tan nan na. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />E man nu e ɲɔxɔ sama kɔntigibae xɔn ma naxee nu hɔrɔmɔlingira tɛtɛ rabilinxi, a nun e sanbunyie, e xa kɔridie, nun e xa luutie.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Munsa, Haruna, nun a xa di xɛmɛe nu yonkinma hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ nan na sogetede mabiri. E tan nan nu e ɲɔxɔ sama hɔrɔmɔlingira xɔn ma Isirayilaka birin xili ra. Xa mixi gbɛtɛ sa a maso hɔrɔmɔlingira ra, na kanyi xa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ di xɛmɛ naxee xa simaya nu bara kike keren li, e xasabi lan mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin nan ma. Munsa nun Haruna nu bara e tɛngɛ e xabilɛ ki ma alɔ Alatala e yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «Di xɛmɛ singe birin tɛngɛ Isirayilakae ya ma, naxee simaya bara kike keren li, i xa e xilie sɛbɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa findi Isirayila di xɛmɛ singe birin ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa gɔɔrɛ xa findi Isirayilakae xa xurusee di singee ɲɔxɔɛ ra. N tan nan na Alatala ra.» <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Munsa naxa Isirayila di xɛmɛ singe birin tɛngɛ alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Isirayila di xɛmɛ singe birin naxee xa simaya bara kike keren li, e xasabi lan mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin mixi kɛmɛ firin tongo solofere nun saxan nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />«Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa findi Isirayila di xɛmɛ singe birin ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa gɔɔrɛ xa findi Isirayilakae xa xurusee di singee ɲɔxɔɛ ra. N tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Na Isirayila di xɛmɛ singe mixi kɛmɛ firin tongo solofere nun saxan naxee xasabi dangi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ kɔnti ra, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />i xa kankan xun sara gbeti giramu tongo suuli nun solofere ra naxan mɔɔli rawalima hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />I xa na gbeti so Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛ yi ra, di singee xunsare ra naxee xasabi nu dangi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xasabi ra.» <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Munsa naxa na gbeti suxu naxan fixi di singee xunsare xa fe ra, naxee xasabi nu dangi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xasabi ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />A naxa na gbeti kilo fu nun suuli nun a tagi rasuxu Isirayila di singee yi ra. Gbeti nan a ra naxan nu rawalima hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Munsa naxa na xunsare gbeti so Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛe yi ra alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Kehati xa mixie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />«Kehati xa die tɛngɛ Lewi bɔnsɔɛe ya ma a xabilɛ nun a denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ tongo saxan li han ɲɛ tongo suuli, naxee fama hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabade. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Kehati xa die lanma e xa mɛɛni se sɛniyɛnxie ma naxee na hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Isirayilakae na keli sigade, Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛe xa dugi yarasa ragoro, e saatɛ kankira makoto a ra. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Na dangi xanbi e xa foye yɛxɛ kiri sa na fari, a nun gɛrɛ dugi. A dɔnxɔɛ ra e xa wuri kuyee raso kankira tongosee ra.»<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />«E na gɛrɛ dugi gbɛtɛ itala teebili ma, e xa piletie, tɔnbilie, nun kundie sa na fari, naxee rawalima wɛni sɛrɛxɛe ra. Taami naxan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra, na fan sama nɛ na teebili nan fari. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />E dugi gbeeli nan sama na birin xun ma, e fa foye yɛxɛ kiri itala na fari. Na dangi xanbi e xa wuri kuyee raso teebili tongosee ra.»<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />«E xa gɛrɛ dugi dusu lanpui dɔxɔse, lanpuie, a yirabasee, xube sasee, nun ture kundie xun ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />E xa na birin mafilin foye yɛxɛ kiri nan kui, e fa a sa xaninse fari. <verse eid="NUM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />E xa gɛrɛ dugi itala sɛrɛxɛbade xɛɛma daaxi fari, e fa a makoto foye yɛxɛ kiri ra, e wuri kuyee raso a tongosee ra. <verse eid="NUM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Na hɔrɔmɔlingira raxunmase birin makotoma garɛ dugi nan na, e e mafilin foye yɛxɛ kiri kui, e fa na sa xaninse fari. <verse eid="NUM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />E xa xube ba sɛrɛxɛbade wure gbeeli daaxi kui, e fa dugi gbeeli dusu a xun na. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />E na a yirabasee sa a fari, alɔ surayi gansee, suxumɛe, pelie, nun pɔɔti xungbee, e xa na birin mafilin foye yɛxɛ kiri ra, e fa wuri kuyee raso a tongose ra. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛe na gɛ na xunmase sɛniyɛnxie nun a yirabasee makotode, Kehati xa die lanma e xa na birin xanin biyaasi kui. Kɔnɔ e mu lanma e xa din na se sɛniyɛnxie ra xa na mu e faxama nɛ. Kehati bɔnsɔɛe xa wali nan na ki. <verse eid="NUM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di xɛmɛ Eleyasari nan a ɲɔxɔ sama lanpui ture, surayi, sansi sɛrɛxɛ, nun ture sɛniyɛnxi xɔn ma. Hɔrɔmɔlingira raxunmase sɛniyɛnxie nun a yirabase birin taxuxi a tan nan na.»<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa nun Haruna bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />«Wo naxa lu Kehati bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe xa ba Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛe xa e mati hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, e fa e xa wali masen kankan bɛ alako e naxa e makɔrɛ se sɛniyɛnxie ra, e fa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />E mu lan e xa e ya masa se sɛniyɛnxie ma, hali dondoronti, xa na mu e faxama nɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gerison xa mixie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />«Gerison bɔnsɔɛ tɛngɛ a xabilɛ nun a denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ tongo saxan li han ɲɛ tongo suuli, naxee fama hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabade. <verse eid="NUM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Gerison xabilɛ xa wali nan yi ki. <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />E hɔrɔmɔlingira mafelenyie nan xaninma, a nun mafelenyi naxan yailanxi foye yɛxɛ kiri ra, a nun mafelenyi naxan gbakuxi hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />E xa tɛtɛ mafelenyie fan xanin naxee hɔrɔmɔlingira nun sɛrɛxɛbade rabilinma, a nun naxan gbakuxi tɛtɛ sode dɛ ra, a nun tɛtɛ luutie. E xa e ɲɔxɔ sa na se mɔɔli birin xɔn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Gerison xabilɛ walima Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛe xa yaamari nan bun ma, a findi kotee xaninfe ra, a findi wali gbɛtɛ rabafe ra. Nee nan a falama e bɛ e lan e xa naxan naba, a nun e lan e xa naxan xanin. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Gerison bɔnsɔɛ xa wali nan na ki hɔrɔmɔlingira xa fe ra. E na wali rabama Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di xɛmɛ Itamari xa yaamari nan bun ma.»<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Merari xa mixie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />«I xa Merari bɔnsɔɛ fan tɛngɛ a xabilɛ nun a denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ tongo saxan li han ɲɛ tongo suuli, naxee fama hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabade. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />See nan yi ki e tan lan e xa naxee maxanin hɔrɔmɔlingira see ra: a xebenyie, a wuri kuyee, a kɔntigibae, nun e sanbunyie. <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />E xa tɛtɛ fan xanin, a nun a kɔntigibae, e sanbunyie, e sɔrɔnsee, e xa luutie, e xa yirabasee, nun e xa walise birin. Wo see masen kankan bɛ, a lanma a xa naxee xanin. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Merari bɔnsɔɛe xa wali birin nan na ki hɔrɔmɔlingira xa fe ra. E walima Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di xɛmɛ Itamari xa yaamari nan bun ma.»<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walikɛe tɛngɛfe Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Munsa, Haruna, nun ɲama kuntigie naxa Kehati xa mixie tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />xɛmɛ naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ tongo saxan li han ɲɛ tongo suuli, naxee fama hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabade. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />E xasabi lan mixi wulu firin, mixi kɛmɛ solofere, tongo suuli nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Xɛmɛe nan na ki Kehati xabilɛe ya ma naxee hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabama. Munsa nun Haruna bara e tɛngɛ alɔ Alatala Munsa yamarixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />E naxa Gerison xa mixie tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />xɛmɛ naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ tongo saxan li han ɲɛ tongo suuli, naxee fama hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabade. <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />E xasabi lan mixi wulu firin, kɛmɛ senni, tongo saxan nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Xɛmɛe nan na ki Gerison xabilɛe ya ma naxee hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabama. Munsa nun Haruna bara e tɛngɛ alɔ Alatala Munsa yamarixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />E naxa Merari xa mixie tɛngɛ e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />xɛmɛ naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ tongo saxan li han ɲɛ tongo suuli, naxee fama hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabade. <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />E xasabi lan mixi wulu saxan mixi kɛmɛ firin nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Xɛmɛe nan na ki Merari xabilɛe ya ma naxee hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabama. Munsa nun Haruna bara e tɛngɛ alɔ Alatala Munsa yamarixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Munsa, Haruna, nun Isirayila kuntigie, e Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixi naxee tɛngɛxi e xabilɛ nun e xa denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />xɛmɛ naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ tongo saxan li han ɲɛ tongo suuli, naxee fama hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabade. <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />E xasabi lan mixi wulu solomasaxan, kɛmɛ suuli, tongo solomasaxan nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Xɛmɛe nun e xa walie nan na ki Lewi naxee tɛngɛxi Munsa nun Haruna saabui ra alɔ Alatala Munsa yamarixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Mixi sɛniyɛntaree, haakɛ tongoe, nun yɛnɛlae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />«Isirayilakae yamari e xa kunɛ kanyi nun kɔrɔsila kanyi birin namini e yonkinde, a nun mixi naxee dinxi fure nde ra, e fa findi sɛniyɛntaree ra. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />A findi xɛmɛ ra, a findi ginɛ ra, wo e ramini wo ya ma, e xa sa lu e xati ma alako e naxa sɛniyɛntareɲa raso wo ya ma, n sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Isirayilakae naxa a raba alɔ Alatala a yamarixi ki naxɛ, e naxa na mixie ramini e ya ma. Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ Munsa bɛ, e naxa a raba na ki.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, a findi xɛmɛ ra, a findi ginɛ ra, naxan yo na haakɛ nde raba a boore ra, haakɛ naxan findima Alatala xui matandife ra, na fe dɔxɔxi a xun ma. <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />A lan nɛ a xa a ti na haakɛ ra, a xa na fe yailan a nun na kanyi tagi, a man fa na fe kanaxi dɔxɔ suuli nde sa na fari. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Xa a sa li a haakɛ rabaxi naxan na, a bara faxa, a xa mixi yo mu na naxan nɔma na fe yailanxi rasuxude, na findima Alatala nan gbe ra, a so sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yi ra. Fe kanɛ man fa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren ba a xa yunubi xafari ra, a a so sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Isirayilakae na sɛrɛxɛ ba, e a fi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ma, na sɛrɛxɛ findima na sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nan gbe ra. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Naxan birin sɛrɛxɛ bama, a naxan bama, a gbe nan na ki, kɔnɔ a naxan fima sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ma, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ gbe nan na ki.»<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, e yi nan nabama xa ginɛ nde sa yɛnɛ raba. <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />Xa e nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ bara e sa gundo ra, ginɛ xa mɔri mu na kolon, seede mu na, mixi mu a suxu a kui, <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />kɔnɔ a xa mɔri bara a xa ginɛ tɔɔnɛ fɔlɔ, xa a xa ginɛ sɛniyɛnxi, xa na mu a mu sɛniyɛnxi, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />a xa a xa ginɛ xanin sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yire, a mɛngi kilo saxan ba a bɛ sɛrɛxɛ ra ture nun surayi mu na naxan xun, barima tɔɔnɛ sɛrɛxɛ nan a ra naxan bama a kolonfe ra xa yunubi rabaxi.»<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />«Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa na ginɛ ti Alatala ya i, <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />a fa xube makɔ bɔxi ma hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, a a masunbu ye sɛniyɛnxi ra fɛɲɛ kui. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Ginɛ na ti Alatala ya i, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa a xunsɛxɛ fulun, a fa tɔɔnɛ sɛrɛxɛ sa ginɛ bɛlɛxɛ maratuse ra. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ tan xa na ye tongo naxan findima danka ra, a a lintan ginɛ ya i.»<verse eid="NUM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />«Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ginɛ rakalima nɛ, a a fala, ‹Xa a sa li i tan nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ mu kafuxi, i mu i xa mɔri yanfa, i mu sɛniyɛntareɲa sɔtɔ futi kui, i xa ratanga dankɛ ma yi ye fama naxan na. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Kɔnɔ xa a sa li, i bara i xa mɔri yanfa wo xa futi kui, i nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ bara kafu sɛniyɛntareɲa kui, <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />Alatala xa a ragiri i furi xa kana. Na kui i ngaxakerenyie i dankama nɛ, e i konbi. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Yi ye naxan fama dankɛ ra, a xa i furi mafuntu, a i xɔrɛ maba.› Ginɛ xa a ratin a falafe ra, ‹Amina, amina.›»<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />«Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ na gɛ na dankɛ sɛbɛde kiri ma, a xa na kiri xa na ye sɛniyɛnxi ra, <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />a fa a fi ginɛ ma, a xa a min. Na ye naxan nɔma findide dankɛ ra, a soma a fate i. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ tɔɔnɛ sɛrɛxɛ rasuxuma nɛ ginɛ yi ra, a a dɛntɛgɛ Alatala bɛ sɛrɛxɛbade yire. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa mɛngi suxui keren gan sɛrɛxɛbade fari, a findi sɛrɛxɛ tɔnxuma ra. A na gɛ na ra, a xa na ye fi ginɛ ma, a xa a min. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />A na na ye min, xa a sa li na ginɛ bara findi sɛniyɛntare ra, a bara a xa mɔri yanfa, na ye naxan findima dankɛ ra, a soma nɛ a fate i, a a tɔɔrɔ ki fanyi ra. A furi funtuma nɛ, a xɔrɛ mabama nɛ, a ngaxakerenyie fama nɛ a dankade.»<verse eid="NUM 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />«Kɔnɔ xa a sa li a mu sɛniyɛntareɲa yo rabaxi, tɔɔɲɛgɛ bama nɛ a xun ma, a man nɔma di baride. <verse eid="NUM 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />Tɔɔnɛ sɛriyɛ nan na ki naxan nawalima xa ginɛ findima sɛniyɛntare ra, a a xa mɔri yanfa futi kui, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />xa na mu a ra, tɔɔnɛ xaxili na so xɛmɛ furi, a fa siikɛ a xa ginɛ ma. A a xa ginɛ xaninma Alatala ya i, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ fa na sɛriyɛ rabatu a xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Na kui yunubi mu na na xɛmɛ ma, kɔnɔ ginɛ tan a xa yunubi sare sɔtɔma nɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Mixi xa sɛriyɛ naxan a yɛtɛ safe Alatala sago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, xa xɛmɛ nde, xa na mu ginɛ nde sa laayidi tongo Alatala bɛ, a xa lu a sago, na nan na ki a xa findi Nasari ra, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />na kanyi mu lan a xa wɛni nun beere min. A naxa sese min naxan kelixi wɛni bogi ma, xa na mu beere ma. A naxa wɛni bogi bunda don, a naxa a xare don. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />A tɛmui naxan birin nabama a xa Nasariya kui, a naxa sese don naxan keli wɛni bili ma, keli a bogi ma a sa dɔxɔ a xɔri ra.»<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />«A xa Nasariya kui, a mu lanma a xunyi xa bi. A xa lu sɛniyɛnyi kui, a xunsɛxɛ xa nu kuya ra tun. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Na waxati bun ma, a mu lan a xa a maso fure ra, <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />hali a findi a baba ra, a nga, a taara, xa na mu a ra a xunya fure ra. A na Alatala nan sago tun, alɔ a xunsɛxɛ kɛɲa a masenxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />A tɛmui naxan birin nabama a xa Nasariya kui, a luma sɛniyɛnyi nan kui Alatala bɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />«Xa mixi nde sa faxa a fɛ ma a tɛrɛnna ki ma, a xunsɛxɛ bara findi se sɛniyɛntare ra. Na tɛmui a xa sɛniyɛn lɔxun keren bun ma, a man fa a xunyi bi na xi solofere lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />A xi solomasaxan lɔxɔɛ, a fogotara firin nan xaninma sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xɔn ma hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra, xa na mu ganbɛ firin. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xɔni keren nan bama yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, boore findima a gan daaxi nan na, alako a xa yunubi xa xafari, barima a dinfe fure ra, na findima yunubi nan na. Na lɔxɔɛ a man xa a xunyi rasɛniyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />A na gɛ na ra, a man xa gbilen a xa laayidi ma. Fo a xa yɛxɛɛ keren ba yɛtɛ ragbilen sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxan ɲɛ keren a ra a xa yunubi xafarife ra. Lɔxɔɛ naxee bara dangi, nee mu kɔntima sɔnɔn, barima a nu bara sɛniyɛntareɲa sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />«Mixi na gɛ Nasariya rabade, a xa bira yi sɛriyɛ nan fɔxɔ ra. A xa siga hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />a xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ba Alatala bɛ, yɛxɛɛ naxan bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxan ma. A xa yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ fan ba, yɛxɛɛ ginɛ naxan bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxan ma. A xa xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ba, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi, lanyuru yo mu na naxan ma. <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />A xa sɛrɛxɛ ndee sa na fari, alɔ sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ, wɛni sɛrɛxɛ, taami lɛbinitare, lɛki yailanxi ture ra, nun lɛki ture masoxi naxee ma. <verse eid="NUM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ na sɛrɛxɛ see nan dɛntɛgɛma Alatala bɛ, a fa yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ba, a nun sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />A xa na taami lɛbinitare masen Alatala bɛ, a xa na yɛxɛɛ kontonyi ba xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra, a xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ sa na fari.»<verse eid="NUM 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />«Na tɛmui Nasari xa a xunsɛxɛ bi hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra, a naxan fixi Alatala ma. A xa na raso tɛ xɔɔra xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ na bafe dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />Nasari na gɛ a xunsɛxɛ bide, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yɛxɛɛ kontonyi bɛlɛxɛ ganxi keren nan tongoma a bɛlɛxɛ ra, a nun lɛki lɛbinitare firin naxee na debe kui. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />A xa e dɛntɛgɛ Alatala bɛ e lintanfe ra. Na findi donse sɛniyɛnxi nan na sɛrɛxɛdubɛ bɛ, a nun na yɛxɛɛ ganyanyi nun a tabe. Na dangi xanbi, Nasari nɔma wɛni minde sɔnɔn. <verse eid="NUM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />Nasari sɛriyɛ nan na ki. A lanma a xa na sɛrɛxɛe ba Alatala bɛ alɔ a ɲanigexi ki naxɛ, a nun se gbɛtɛe a nɔma naxan na. Fo a xa a xa Nasari laayidi rakamali a sɛriyɛ ki ma.»<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />«A fala Haruna nun a xa die bɛ, e xa duba Isirayilakae bɛ yi ki nɛ:<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />‹Alatala xa baraka sa i xa fe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:24">a xa i kanta.<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Alatala yatagi xa nɔrɔ i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:25">a xa hinnɛ i ra.<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Alatala xa a ya rafindi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:26">a xa bɔɲɛsa fi i ma.›<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />E dubama Isirayilakae bɛ na ki nɛ, n fan baraka sama nɛ e ma.»<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Hadiya naxee fixi hɔrɔmɔlingira rabi tɛmui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Munsa to gɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira tide, a naxa ture sɛniyɛnxi sa a ma, a nun a xunmasee, a xa sɛrɛxɛbadee, nun a yirabasee, alako nee xa sɛniyɛn Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Isirayila kuntigie, xabilɛ xunyi naxee bɔnsɔɛe tɛngɛ, e naxa hadiyae ba Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />E naxa fa sarɛti makotoxi senni nun ninge fu nun firin na hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra, e xa findi e xa sɛrɛxɛ ra Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />«Yi hadiyae rasuxu e yi ra hɔrɔmɔlingira wali xa fe ra. E taxu Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa mixie ra kankan xa wali bɛrɛ ra.» <verse eid="NUM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Munsa naxa na sarɛtie nun ningee so Lewi xa mixie yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />A naxa sarɛti firin nun ninge naani so Gerison xabilɛ yi ra e xa wali bɛrɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />A naxa sarɛti naani nun ninge solomasaxan so Merari xabilɛ yi ra e xa wali bɛrɛ ra. E nu na Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di Itamari xa yaamari nan bun ma. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Kɔnɔ a mu sese so Kehati xabilɛ tan yi, barima a nu lanma e xa se sɛniyɛnxie maxanin e tunki fari alɔ Alatala e yamarixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Sɛrɛxɛbade nɛɛnɛ xa wali singe, ture sɛniyɛnxi to maso a ma tɛmui naxɛ, kuntigie naxa fa e xa sɛrɛxɛe ra sɛrɛxɛbade yire. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Alatala nu bara a masen Munsa bɛ, «Lɔxɔɛ yo lɔxɔɛ mixi keren xa fa a xa hadiya ra sɛrɛxɛbade nɛɛnɛ xa fe ra.» <verse eid="NUM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Na lɔxɔɛ singe, Aminadabo xa di Naxason kelife Yuda bɔnsɔɛ, <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Aminadabo xa di Naxason xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Na lɔxɔɛ firin nde, Suwara xa di Netaneeli kelife Isakari bɔnsɔɛ, <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Suwara xa di Netaneeli xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Na lɔxɔɛ saxan nde, Xelon xa di Eliyabi kelife Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ, <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Xelon xa di Eliyabi xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Na lɔxɔɛ naani nde, Sedeyuri xa di Elisuru kelife Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Sedeyuri xa di Elisuru xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Na lɔxɔɛ suuli nde, Surisadayi xa di Selumiyeli kelife Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ, <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Surisadayi xa di Selumiyeli xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Na lɔxɔɛ senni nde, Duweli xa di Eliyasafa fatanfe Gadi bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Duweli xa di Eliyasafa xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Na lɔxɔɛ solofere nde, Amixudi xa di Elisama fatanfe Efirami bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Amixudi xa di Elisama xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Na lɔxɔɛ solomasaxan nde, Pedasuru xa di Gamaliyɛli fatanfe Manasi bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Pedasuru xa di Gamaliyɛli xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Na lɔxɔɛ solomanaani nde, Gideyoni xa di Abidan fatanfe Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Gideyoni xa di Abidan xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Na lɔxɔɛ fu nde, Amisadayi xa di Axiyeseri fatanfe Dana bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Amisadayi xa di Axiyeseri xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Na lɔxɔɛ fu nun keren nde, Okiran xa di Pagiyɛli fatanfe Aseri bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Aminadabo xa di Naxason xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Na lɔxɔɛ fu nun firin nde, Enan xa di Axira fatanfe Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />a naxa fa yi hadiyae ra: pileti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo fu nun suuli ra, a nun pɔɔti keren naxan yailanxi gbeti kilo keren na alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. E firin nafexi sansi xɔri dinxi ra, ture masunbuxi naxan na, alako a xa findi sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />A man naxa fa pɔɔti keren na naxan yailanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani ra, naxan nafexi surayi ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />a nun naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra alɔ tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ keren naxan xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li, <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />a nun naxee bama xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra alɔ ninge firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi suuli, nun yɛxɛɛ suuli naxee xa simaya bara ɲɛ keren li. Enan xa di Axira xa hadiya nan na ki.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Isirayila kuntigie xa hadiya malanxie findixi yi nan na sɛrɛxɛbade nɛɛnɛ xa fe ra: pileti gbeti daaxi fu nun firin, pɔɔti gbeti daaxi fu nun firin, nun pɔɔti xɛɛma daaxi fu nun firin. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Pileti keren keren lanxi gbeti kilo keren nun a tagi nan ma. Pɔɔti keren keren lanxi gbeti kilo keren nan ma. Se naxee yailanxi gbeti ra, nee lanxi kilo mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nan ma, alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Pɔɔti xɛɛma daaxi fu nun firin lanxi xɛɛma giramu kɛmɛ giramu fu nun naani nan ma, alɔ se maniyama ki naxɛ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. Na pɔɔti fu nun firin lanxi xɛɛma kilo keren nun a tagi nan ma. E birin nafexi surayi nan na. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi xuruse xasabi naxa lan tuura fu nun firin ma, a nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi fu nun firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun firin naxee xa simaya nu bara ɲɛ keren li, a nun e xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ. Yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ xuruse xasabi naxa lan sikɔtɛ fu nun firin ma. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ xa xuruse xasabi naxa lan tuura mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani ma, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi tongo senni, sikɔtɛ tongo senni, nun yɛxɛɛ tongo senni naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ. Nee nan findi hadiyae ra sɛrɛxɛbade xa wali fɔlɔ tɛmui, ture sɛniyɛnxi to sa a ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Munsa to so hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, a nun Alatala xa sumun, a naxa Alatala xui mɛ saatɛ kankira dɛrakote fari, a masenyi tima a bɛ malekɛ firinyie sawurɛ tagi naxee na na kankira fari.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Lanpuie dɔxɔfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />«A fala Haruna bɛ, a xa lanpui solofere dɔxɔ alako e xa yanba e dɔxɔse ya ra.» <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Haruna a raba na ki nɛ. A naxa lanpui dɔxɔ alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ Munsa bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Lanpuie dɔxɔse nu rafalaxi xɛɛma dinxi nan na, kelife a sanbunyi ma han a xunyi, alɔ Alatala a masenxi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />«Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ba Isirayilakae ya ma, i xa e rasɛniyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />I e rasɛniyɛnma yi ki nɛ. Marasɛniyɛn ye makasan e ma. E xa e fate maxabe birin bi, e xa e xa dugie xa, alako e xa sɛniyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Na xanbi, e xa tuura keren ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, a nun mɛngi naxan masunbuxi ture ra. I xa tuura gbɛtɛ ba yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />I xa Lewi bɔnsɔɛ nun Isirayilaka birin malan hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Mɛnni, Alatala ya xɔri, Isirayilakae xa e bɛlɛxɛ sa Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie ma. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Haruna nan fama e dɛntɛgɛde Alatala bɛ e xa lu alɔ sɛrɛxɛ Isirayilakae ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Na kui e nɔma Alatala xa wali rabade.»<verse eid="NUM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />«Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie xa e bɛlɛxɛ sa na tuura firinyie ma. Keren bama yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ nan na, boore ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, alako e xa yunubie xa xafari. <verse eid="NUM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ na ti Haruna nun a xa die ya i, i xa e dɛntɛgɛ a sɛrɛxɛ ki ma Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />A lima nɛ, na tɛmui, i bara Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tan ba Isirayilakae ya ma, e xa findi n gbe ra.»<verse eid="NUM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />«I na gɛ e rasɛniyɛnde a sɛrɛxɛ ki ma, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ fama nɛ sode e xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali kui. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Isirayilakae nan e ra naxee findixi n gbe ra Isirayila di singe birin ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Isirayila di singe birin nun e xa xuruse di singe birin findixi n gbe nan na, kafi n sa Misirakae xa di singe birin faxa tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />N naxa Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tongo Isirayila di singe birin ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />N bara e so Haruna nun a xa die yi ra Isirayilakae tagi, alako e xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali raba Isirayilakae xili ra. E man xa yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ba Isirayilakae bɛ, alako gbaloe yo naxa goro Isirayilakae ma e na makɔrɛ yire sɛniyɛnxi ra tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Munsa, Haruna, nun ɲama birin naxa na raba Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ra alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ naxa e yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, e naxa e xa dugie xa. Haruna naxa e dɛntɛgɛ Alatala bɛ. A naxa e xa yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ba e bɛ e xa sɛniyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Na to ba a ra, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ naxa fa e xa wali suxu hɔrɔmɔlingira xa fe ra Haruna nun a xa die xa yaamari bun ma, alɔ Alatala a yamari Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />«Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixie xa simaya na ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli li, e nɔma hɔrɔmɔlingira wali suxude. <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />E na ɲɛ tongo suuli sɔtɔ, e xa na wali lu naa. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />E nɔma e ngaxakerenyie malide na wali kui, kɔnɔ e tan mu nɔma na rabade sɔnɔn. I xa na sɛriyɛe suxu Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra hɔrɔmɔlingira wali rabafe ma.»<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Isirayilakae to mini Misira bɔxi ma, e fa lu gbengberen yire ɲɛ firin, na kike singe Alatala nu bara a masen Munsa bɛ Turusinina gbengberenyi ma, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />«Isirayilakae xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />yi kike xi fu nun naani, soge dula tɛmui alɔ a yamarixi ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Munsa naxa a fala Isirayilakae bɛ, a e xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />E naxa na sali raba kike singe xi fu nun naani soge dula tɛmui Turusinina gbengberenyi ma. E naxa a raba, alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ Munsa bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Kɔnɔ na lɔxɔɛ, mixi ndee mu nɔ Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba barima e nu bara din mixi fure ra, e fa findi sɛniyɛntare ra na lɔxɔɛ. Na lɔxɔɛ kerenyi e naxa siga Munsa nun Haruna yire. <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />E a fala e bɛ, «Muxu mu sɛniyɛn fure xa fe ra, kɔnɔ munfe ra muxu mu lan muxu xa fa muxu xa hadiya ra Alatala bɛ alɔ Isirayilaka birin?» <verse eid="NUM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Munsa naxa e yaabi, «Wo mamɛ ti sinden, n xa a mato Alatala naxan yamarima wo xa fe ra.» <verse eid="NUM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />«Xa wo mu sɛniyɛn fure nde xa fe ra, xa na mu a ra wo na biyaasi kui, wo man nɔma Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali rabade Alatala xa binyɛ bun ma, keli wo tan ma han a sa wo bɔnsɔɛ li. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Kɔnɔ e tan xa a raba kike firin nde xi fu nun naani soge dula tɛmui. E yɛxɛɛ don a nun taami lɛbinitare nun burɛxɛ xɔnɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />A dɔnxɔɛ yo naxa lu han gɛɛsɛgɛ. A xɔri fan mu ibɔɔma. E xa na sali raba a sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Kɔnɔ xa mixi sɛniyɛnxi naxan mu na biyaasi kui, a tondi Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali rabade, na kanyi lanma a xa ba Alatala xa ɲama ya ma, barima a mu fa hadiya ra Alatala bɛ a waxati. Na kanyi fama nɛ a xa yunubi sare sɔtɔde.»<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />«Xa i xa xɔɲɛ nde wama Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali rabafe, a xa a raba a sɛriyɛ ki ma. Sɛriyɛ naxan saxi taa kanyie ma, na sɛriyɛ kerenyi nan luma na xɔɲɛ fan ma.»<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Hɔrɔmɔlingira ti lɔxɔɛ, saatɛ walaxɛe na dɛnnaxɛ, nuxui nde naxa dusu na xun na. Keli nunmare han kuye iba, a nu na hɔrɔmɔlingira fari, a maniyaxi tɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Tɛmui birin a nu na na ki nɛ, nuxui nu na hɔrɔmɔlingira fari yanyi ra, a fa yanba alɔ tɛ kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Nuxui nɛfɛ keli hɔrɔmɔlingira xun ma, Isirayilakae fan bara keli, e ɲɛrɛ fɔlɔ han a goro, e fa yonkin mɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Na kui Isirayilakae nu ɲɛrɛma Alatala xa yaamari nan bun ma, e man nu yonkinma Alatala xa yaamari nan ma. Fanni nuxui na hɔrɔmɔlingira xun ma, e fan yonkinma mɛnni nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Xa nuxui sa bu hɔrɔmɔlingira fari a gbe ra, Isirayilakae nu birama Alatala xa yaamari nan fɔxɔ ra, e lu mɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Tɛmui ndee na nuxui mu buma, a keli. Isirayilakae nu luma Alatala xa yaamari nan bun ma, e fan keli, e yonkin nuxui yire. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Tɛmui ndee nuxui bara lu yire xi keren, keli kɔɛ ra han kuye iba, a fa siga. A nɛfɛ keli, Isirayilakae fan bara keli, e bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Xa nuxui lu hɔrɔmɔlingira xun ma xi firin, xa na mu kike keren, xa na mu ɲɛ keren, Isirayilakae mu nu kelima e yonkinde, fo na nuxui na keli hɔrɔmɔlingira xun ma tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />E nu yonkinma Alatala xa yaamari nan bun ma, e nu kelima Alatala xa yaamari nan bun ma. E nu birama Alatala xa yaamari nan fɔxɔ ra, a naxan fixi Munsa saabui ra.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Sara firin gbeti daaxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />«I xa sara firin yailan gbeti bɔnbɔxi ra. E rawalima ɲama xilife nan na malanyi. E man nawalima ɲama kelife nan na biyaasi tɛmui. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />E firin na fe tɛmui keren, ɲama birin xa malan i yire hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Xa sara keren nan fe, Isirayila yareratie nun kuntigie gbansan xa malan i yire.»<verse eid="NUM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />«Wo kelima biyaaside tɛmui naxɛ, sarae xa fe keren. Na kui naxee dɔxɔxi sogetede, e xa siga. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Sarae na fe firin, naxee dɔxɔxi yirefanyi ma, nee fan xa siga. Sara xui nan a masenma ɲama siga tɛmui bara a li. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Sara xui kɛɲa gbɛtɛ nan a masenma ɲama malan tɛmui bara a li.»<verse eid="NUM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />«Haruna bɔnsɔɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nan na sarae fema. Sɛriyɛ nan na ra wo tan nun wo bɔnsɔɛe bɛ abadan. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Wo na wo yaxuie gere wo xa bɔxi ma tɛmui naxɛ, wo xa na sarae fe. Alatala ɲɔxɔ sama nɛ wo xɔn, a wo ratanga wo yaxuie ma. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Wo xa sali lɔxɔɛ xungbee nun wo xa kike nɛɛnɛ sali lɔxɔɛe, wo man xa na sarae fe wo sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe bama tɛmui naxɛ. Na nan a niyama, n nan n ɲɔxɔ sama wo xɔn ma. N tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra.»<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae tife kira xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Ɲɛ firin nde kike firin nde xi mɔxɔɲɛn lɔxɔɛ, nuxui naxan nu dɔxɔxi hɔrɔmɔlingira xun ma, Ala xa seede nu na dɛnnaxɛ, a naxa ɲɛrɛ fɔlɔ. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Na kui Isirayilakae naxa keli Turusinina gbengberenyi ma, e bira na nuxui fɔxɔ ra han a sa ti Paran gbengberenyi xun ma. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Alatala naxa e yamari Annabi Munsa saabui ra, e xa na biyaasi singe fɔlɔ.<verse eid="NUM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ naxa ti yare, e xa tɔnxuma tixi e ya ra. E xunyi nu na Aminadabo xa di xɛmɛ Naxason nan na. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Suwara xa di xɛmɛ Netaneeli nan nu na Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Xelon xa di xɛmɛ Eliyabi nan nu na Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Hɔrɔmɔlingira to mafagati, Gerison xa di xɛmɛe nun Merari xa di xɛmɛe naxa a xanin.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra, e xa tɔnxuma tixi e ya ra. Sedeyuri xa di xɛmɛ Elisuru nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra. Surisadayi xa di xɛmɛ nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Gadi bɔnsɔɛ naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra. Duweli xa di xɛmɛ Eliyasafa nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Kehati xabilɛ naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra hɔrɔmɔlingira se sɛniyɛnxie ra. Booree tan lan nɛ e xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ti beenu Kehati xabilɛ xa so. <verse eid="NUM 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra, e xa tɔnxuma tixi e ya ra. Amixudi xa di xɛmɛ Elisama nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra. Pedasuru xa di xɛmɛ Gamaliyɛli nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Gideyoni xa di xɛmɛ Abidan nan nu na Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Dana bɔnsɔɛe naxa ɲɛrɛ e birin xanbi ra, e xa tɔnxuma tixi e ya ra. Amisadayi xa di xɛmɛ Axiyeseri nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Okiran xa di xɛmɛ Pagiyɛli nan nu na Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Enan xa di xɛmɛ Axira nan nu na Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xunyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Isirayilakae nu ɲɛrɛma na ki nɛ e gali ki ma.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelife Turusinina geya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Munsa naxa a fala a bitanyi Reyuweli Madiyanka xa di xɛmɛ Xobabo bɛ, «Muxu na sigafe Alatala dɛnnaxan laayidixi muxu bɛ. I fan xa fa. Na findima sɔɔnɛya nan na i bɛ, barima Alatala bara laayidi tongo a fe fanyie rabama nɛ Isirayila bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Xobabo naxa a yaabi, «Ade, n xa gbilen n xɔnyi n ma mixie tagi.» <verse eid="NUM 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Munsa naxa a maxandi, «Yandi, i naxa keli muxu xun ma. I tan nan yi gbengberenyi birin kolon muxu nɔma yonkinde dɛnnaxɛ. I findima muxu raɲɛrɛma nan na. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Xa i muxu matima, muxu i kima nɛ hɛɛri ra Alatala fama naxan fide muxu ma.»<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />E naxa keli Alatala xa geya bun ma, e xi saxan ɲɛrɛ raba. Alatala xa saatɛ kankira nu tixi e ya ra na xi saxan bun ma yonkinde fenfe ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />E to nu kelima e yonkinde, Alatala xa nuxui nu tixi e xun ma fɛɛɲɛnyi kui. <verse eid="NUM 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />E to nu saatɛ kankira rakelima tɛmui naxɛ, Munsa nu a falama, «Alatala, i xa keli, i xa i yaxuie rayensen. Naxee i xɔnxi, nee fan xa e gi i ya ra.» <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />E to nu saatɛ kankira ragoroma tɛmui naxɛ, Munsa nu a falama, «Alatala, i xa i magoro Isirayila ɲama wuyaxi tagi.»<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae mawafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Lɔxɔɛ nde, ɲama naxa e mawa e xa tɔɔrɛ xa fe ra Alatala ya i. Alatala naxa xɔnɔ na fe ma, a fa tɛ rasin ɲama tagi, a yire nde gan yonkinde sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Ɲama to gbelegbele Munsa ra, a naxa Alatala maxandi. Na kui tɛ naxa xuben. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />E naxa na yire xili sa Tabera, na nan na ki «Tɛ mankanɛ,» barima Alatala nu bara tɛ rasin e tagi.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Mixi kobi ndee to wa donse mɔɔli gbɛtɛ xɔn ma, Isirayilakae man naxa e mawa, a falafe ra, «Muxu wama sube nan xɔn! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Muxu muxu ratuma na donse fanyi ma muxu naxan sɔtɔ Misira bɔxi ma kɔbiri xanbi, alɔ yɛxɛ, kaakunboosi, basikɛti, yɛbɛ, nun yɛbɛ maniyɛ. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi donse xɔli mu na muxu ma, barima ‹mana› donse nan tun na be.»<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Na «mana» nu luxi nɛ alɔ funden xɔri fiixɛ. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Ɲama nu minima a matongode, e fa a din gɛmɛ ra, xa na mu, mulunyi kui. E nu lɛki yailanma a ra. A nu luxi alɔ ture nu na a ma. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Mana nu goroma xini goro tɛmui.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Munsa naxa ɲama wa xui ramɛ. Mixi birin nu e mawama e xɔnyi. Alatala naxa xɔnɔ ki fanyi ra. Munsa naxa kɔntɔfili. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />A naxa Alatala maxɔrin, «N Marigi, munfe ra i bara yi kɔntɔfili lu i xa konyi ma? N munse rabaxi naxan a niyama i xa yi ɲama xa kote dɔxɔ n xun ma? N tan nan nu wama a xɔn? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />N tan nan e barixi? Munfe ra i bara e sa n bɛlɛxɛ, n xa e xanin bɔxi ma i naxan laayidixi e benbae bɛ, alɔ dingɛ a xa di xaninma ki naxɛ? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />N sube sɔtɔma minden yi ɲama birin bɛ? E e mawama e wama sube xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />N keren mu nɔma yi ɲama birin xa kote ra, a binya n bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Faxɛ nan fisa na kote bɛ. Xa n ma fe rafan i ma, i naxa n xun nakana.»<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «Isirayila fori tongo solofere malan n bɛ, i naxee kolon taa yareratie nun kuntigie ra. E xa e malan hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra i sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />N fama gorode i yire, won xa wɔyɛn. N Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxan fixi i ma, n na nde bama i ma, n xa na sa e fan ma, alako i keren naxa yi ɲama xa kote xanin sɔnɔn. Wo nun na kuntigie nan a xaninma fa.»<verse eid="NUM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />«A fala ɲama bɛ, ‹Wo xa wo yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, barima tina wo sube donma nɛ. Alatala bara wo wa xui mɛ, a falafe ra, «Muxu wama sube nan xɔn ma. Lufe Misira nan fisa.» Alatala fama sube fide wo ma wo naxan donma. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Kɔnɔ wo mu a donma xɛ xi keren, xa na mu xi firin, xa na mu xi suuli, xa na mu xi fu, xa na mu xi mɔxɔɲɛn. <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />Wo a donma nɛ han kike keren, han a mini wo ɲɔɛ kui, han a raɲaaxu wo ma, barima wo bara Alatala rabɛɲin, naxan na wo ya ma. Wo bara wo mawa a falafe ra, «Munfe ra muxu minixi Misira?»›»<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Munsa naxa a masen Alatala bɛ, «I a falama i sube fima yi ɲama ma kike keren bun ma? N na xɛmɛ wulu kɛmɛ senni nan ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Xuruse gɔɔrɛ mu nɔma e ralide sube ra. Hali yɛxɛ naxee na baa ma, e mu nɔma e ralide.» <verse eid="NUM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Alatala naxa a yaabi, «N sɛnbɛ xurun na rabade? I fama a kolonde xa n ma wɔyɛnyi findixi nɔndi nan na.»<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Munsa naxa siga Alatala xa masenyi dɛntɛgɛde ɲama bɛ. A naxa ɲama forie mixi tongo solofere malan Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira rabilinyi. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Alatala naxa goro nuxui kui, a masenyi ti Munsa bɛ. A naxa a yɛtɛ Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nde tongo naxan nu na Munsa ma, a a sa na fori mixi tongo solofere ma. Na Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi to goro e ma, e naxa so masenyi tife Ala xili ra, kɔnɔ e mu a ikuya.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Kɔnɔ xɛmɛ firin nu na na fori tongo solofere ya ma naxee mu siga malanyi. E mu siga hɔrɔmɔlingira yire, e naxa lu yonkinde kui. Kɔnɔ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro e fan ma, e fa masenyi ti Ala xili ra ɲama tagi. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Fonike nde naxa a gi, a sa a fala Munsa bɛ, «Eledade nun Medadi na masenyi tife Ala xili ra ɲama tagi.» <verse eid="NUM 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe, naxan nu Munsa malima kafi a fonike tɛmui, a naxa a fala Munsa bɛ, «N marigi, i xa na fe dan.» <verse eid="NUM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Munsa naxa a yaabi, «I tɔɔnɛ tife n tan nan ma fe ra? A xɔli n ma Alatala xa ɲama birin findi namiɲɔnmɛe ra naxee bara Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ!» <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Na tɛmui, Munsa nun Isirayila kuntigie naxa gbilen ɲama ya ma.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Alatala naxa foye xungbe ramini kelife baa ma, naxan xɔni gbegbe radin ɲama yonkinde rabilinyi, han kelife yonkinde tagi, a sa dɔxɔ fɛɛɲɛn keren ɲɛrɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Ɲama naxa fɛɛɲɛn na xɔnie matongo ra, han na kuye iba. E man naxa fɛɛɲɛn xɔnie matongo ra, han kankan naxa paani ya fu sɔtɔ, litiri kɛmɛ saxan tongo suuli sama paani naxan kui. E naxa e rafen e xa yonkinde rabilinyi. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Kɔnɔ beenu Isirayilakae xa gɛ na sube donde, Alatala naxa xɔnɔ e ma, a e ɲaxankata a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />E naxa na yire xili sa Kibiroti Hataawa, na nan na ki «milante gaburi,» barima milante gali nan nagata mɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Ɲama naxa keli Kibiroti Hataawa, e sa yonkin Xaseroti.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Mariyama nun Haruna Munsa xili kanafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Munsa to nu bara Kusi ginɛ dɔxɔ, Mariyama nun Haruna naxa Munsa mafala, <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />a falafe ra, «Alatala wɔyɛnma Munsa nan gbansan saabui ra? A mu wɔyɛnma muxu fan saabui ra?» Alatala naxa na masenyi mɛ. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Munsa nu findixi yɛtɛ magoroe nan na dangife mixi birin na.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Alatala naxa Munsa, Haruna, nun Mariyama xili keren na, a e birin xa siga hɔrɔmɔlingira. E to siga naa, <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Alatala naxa goro nuxui kui hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra. A naxa Haruna nun Mariyama xili. E firin naxa e maso a ra. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Alatala naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo tuli mati n ma masenyi ra. N namiɲɔnmɛ xɛɛma wo ya ma tɛmui naxɛ, n nan n yɛtɛ masenma na kanyi bɛ laamatunyi nan kui. N wɔyɛn a ra xiye ra. <verse eid="NUM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Kɔnɔ n ma konyi Munsa tan gbe mu na na ki xɛ. A tan findixi n dugutɛgɛ nan na n ma wali birin kui. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />N na n ma masenyi makɛnɛnma a bɛ, n mu taali wɔyɛnyi rawalima muxu tagi. N nan n yɛtɛ masenma a bɛ, a fa n niini igbɛfe. Munfe ra wo mu gaaxu n ma konyi Munsa mafalafe ra?»<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Alatala naxa xɔnɔ e ma, a fa keli e xun ma. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Nuxui to keli hɔrɔmɔlingira xun ma, Mariyama fate naxa rafiixɛ kunɛ ra keren na. Haruna to a to, kunɛ na Mariyama fate birin ma, <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />a naxa Munsa mayandi, «Yandi, n marigi, i naxa muxu ratɔn muxu xa yunubi xa fe ra, muxu naxan nabaxi muxu xa xaxilitareɲa kui. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Mariyama naxa lu alɔ di naxan faxaxi a nga furi, naxan fate sɛɛti bɔrɔxi beenu a bari tɛmui.» <verse eid="NUM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Munsa naxa a xui rate Alatala ma, «N Marigi, n bara i maxandi, a rayalan!» <verse eid="NUM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Alatala naxa a yaabi, «Xa a baba dɛye bɔxun a yatagi, a mu yaagima xɛ han lɔxun keren? I xa a ramini ɲama ya ma. A na ge lɔxun keren nabade ɲama yonkinde fari ma, wo nɔma a rasode wo ya ma.» <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Na kui, e naxa a ramini ɲama ya ma, a xi solofere raba yonkinde fari ma. Ɲama mu keli e yonkinde han Mariyama naxa ragbilen e ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Na to ba a ra, ɲama naxa keli Xaseroti, e naxa sa yonkin Paran gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kanaan bɔxi rabɛnfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />«I xa yarerati keren keren sugandi bɔnsɔɛ birin ya ma, i xa e xɛɛ Kanaan bɔxi ma, e xa sa na bɔxi rabɛn, n naxan fima Isirayilakae ma.» <verse eid="NUM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Munsa naxa na mixie xɛɛ kelife Paran gbengberenyi ma, alɔ Alatala a yamarixi ki naxɛ. Na mixi birin findi Isirayila kuntigie nan na. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />E xilie nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 13:4">Kelife Ruben bɔnsɔɛ ma, Sakuru xa di xɛmɛ Samuwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Kelife Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ ma, Xori xa di xɛmɛ Safati.<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Kelife Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ma, Yefune xa di xɛmɛ Kalebi.<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Kelife Isakari bɔnsɔɛ ma, Yusufu xa di xɛmɛ Yigali.<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Kelife Efirami bɔnsɔɛ ma, Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Hoseya.<verse eid="NUM 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Kelife Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ ma, Rafu xa di xɛmɛ Paliti.<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Kelife Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ ma, Sodi xa di xɛmɛ Gadiyeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Kelife Yusufu xa di, Manasi bɔnsɔɛ ma, Susi xa di xɛmɛ Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Kelife Dana bɔnsɔɛ ma, Gemali xa di xɛmɛ Amiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Kelife Aseri bɔnsɔɛ ma, Mikayeli xa di xɛmɛ Seturu.<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Kelife Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ ma, Fofisi xa di xɛmɛ Naxabi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Kelife Gadi bɔnsɔɛ ma, Maki xa di xɛmɛ Geyuweli.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Xɛmɛe xilie nan na ki Munsa naxee xɛɛ Kanaan bɔxi rabɛnde. Munsa naxa Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Hoseya xili sa Yosuwe.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Munsa to e xɛɛ Kanaan bɔxi rabɛnde, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo xa mini Negewi gbengberenyi biri, han wo geyae yire li. <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />Wo xa na bɔxi rabɛn, wo xa a kolon xa mɛnnikae sɛnbɛ gbo, xa e sɛnbɛ mu gbo, xa e wuya, xa e mu wuya. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Wo xa a mato xa na bɔxi fan. Wo xa a kolon xa tɛtɛ na na taae rabilinyi ma. <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Wo xa a mato xa na bɔxi fan sansi bɛ, xa wurie gbo naa. Wo kata wo xa fa na sansi bogi ndee ra.» Wɛni bilie bogi singe tɛmui nan nu a ra.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />E naxa sa na bɔxi rabɛn, kelife Sini gbengberenyi ma, han Rexobo, Xamata mabiri. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />E naxa dangi Negewi gbengberenyi ra, e sa Xebiron li, Anaki xa die Aximan, Sɛsayi, nun Talamayi nu sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ. Xebiron taa nu tixi ɲɛ solofere beenu Sowan taa xa ti Misira. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />E to Esekoli gulunba li, e naxa wɛni bili salonyi nde rasɛgɛ, a tɔnsɔɛ nu na naxan ma. Mixi firin naxa na xanin wuri kuye ra. E naxa xɔrɛ bogi nde fan tongo, a nun bogise nde naxan xili girenadi, naxan maniyɛ kɔɔbɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />E naxa na yire xili sa Esekoli, na nan na ki «Tɔnsɔɛ yire,» na wɛni bogi tɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra, e naxan baxi.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />E to xi tongo naani raba naa na bɔxi rabɛnde, e naxa gbilen <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Munsa, Haruna, nun Isirayila ɲama yire. E nu na Kadesi, Paran gbengberenyi ma. Mɛnni e naxa dɛntɛgɛ sa, e na bɔxi sansi bogie masen e bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />E naxa a fala Munsa bɛ, «Muxu so nɛ bɔxi ma, i muxu xɛɛ dɛnnaxɛ. Bɔxi nan a ra, kumi nun xiɲɛ xɛlɛma dɛnnaxɛ. Na bogise ndee nan ya. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Kɔnɔ ɲama naxan sabatixi na bɔxi ma, e sɛnbɛ gbo. Tɛtɛ dɔxɔxi taa birin na. Taa xungbe nan e ra. Muxu Anaki bɔnsɔɛ yati toxi nɛ naa. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Amalɛkikae sabatixi Negewi gbengberenyi nan ma. Xitikae, Yebusukae, nun Amorikae, nee nan sabatixi geya yire. Kanaankae tan sabatixi baa dɛ nan na, a nun Yurudɛn xure dɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Kalebi naxa ɲama masabari Munsa ya xɔri, a falafe ra, «Won xɛɛ! Won xa yi bɔxi findi won gbe ra. Won nɔma na rabade.» <verse eid="NUM 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Kɔnɔ boore naxee siga bɔxi rabɛnde, nee naxa a fala, «Won mu nɔma sigade na ɲama gerede. E sɛnbɛ gbo won bɛ!» <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Na kui e naxa fe ɲaaxi fala na bɔxi xa fe ra Isirayila ɲama bɛ. E naxa a fala, «Muxu bɔxi naxan nabɛnxi, bɔxi nan a ra naxan mixi faxama. Mixi gbangbalanyie sabatixi naa. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Muxu anabiyoroe to nɛ naxan fatanxi Anaki bɔnsɔɛ ra. Muxu nu luxi nɛ alɔ katoe e mabiri. E tan yo, muxu tan yo, e birin a toxi na ki nɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae Ala matandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Ɲama naxa wa xui ramini kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Isirayilaka birin nu fa wɔyɛn na Munsa nun Haruna ma, e nu a fala, «A nu fisa muxu xa faxa Misira, xa na mu a ra yi gbengberen yire. <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Munfe ra Alatala muxu rasofe yi bɔxi ma, muxu xa faxa santidɛgɛma ra, muxu xa die nun muxu xa ginɛe xa suxu gere kui. A mu fisa muxu xa gbilen Misira?» <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />E naxa a fala e booree bɛ, «Won mangɛ keren ti won xun na, won xa gbilen Misira.»<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Munsa nun Haruna naxa e yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma Isirayilaka birin ya xɔri. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe nun Yefune xa di xɛmɛ Kalebi naxa e xa donma ibɔɔ sunnunyi kui. Na mixi firin nu na na xɛɛrae ya ma, naxee siga Kanaan bɔxi rabɛnde. <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />E naxa fa yi masenyi ti ɲama bɛ, «Muxu bɔxi naxan matoxi, bɔxi fanyi fanyi nan a ra. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Xiɲɛ nun kumi yire nan a ra. Xa Alatala na won bɛ, a won nasoma nɛ naa, a na bɔxi fi won ma. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Yandi, wo naxa Alatala matandi. Wo naxa gaaxu na bɔxi mixie ya ra. Won nɔma nɛ e ra. E sanke yo mu na sɔnɔn, barima Alatala na won tan nan bɛ. Wo naxa gaaxu e ya ra.»<verse eid="NUM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Ɲama nu wama e magɔnɔfe, kɔnɔ Alatala xa nɔrɛ naxa mini hɔrɔmɔlingira Isirayilaka birin ya xɔri. <verse eid="NUM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «Yi ɲama bama n maberefe mun tɛmui? Munfe ra e siikɛma hali n kaabanakoe rabama e tagi? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />N xa wuganyi radin e ma, n nee faxa. Na tɛmui n bɔnsɔɛ xungbe sɛnbɛma nde rakelima nɛ i saabui ra, naxan dangi e tan na.»<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Munsa naxa Alatala yaabi, «Misirakae bara a kolon, a i yi ɲama ramini e xa bɔxi ra i sɛnbɛ nan na. <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />E bara bekae rakolon. Nee bara a mɛ, a i tan Alatala na i xa ɲama fɔxɔ ra, a i i yɛtɛ masenma e ma, a i nuxui sama e xun ma, a i ɲɛrɛma e ya ra nuxui kui yanyi ra, nun tɛ kui kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Xa i fa yi ɲama birin faxa kerenyi ra, bɔnsɔɛ naxee i xa fe mɛxi, e a falama nɛ, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‹Alatala sɛnbɛ yo mu nu nɔma yi ɲama rasode bɔxi ma, a naxan laayidixi e bɛ. Na nan a ra, a e birin sɔntɔ gbengberenyi ma.›»<verse eid="NUM 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />«I xa i sɛnbɛ masen e bɛ, alɔ i tan yati a yitaxi ki naxɛ, a falafe ra, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‹N mu xɔnɔma mafuren mafuren. N ma diɲɛ nun fanyi gbo. N mixie xa yunubie nun fe ɲaaxie xafarima. Kɔnɔ n mixi kobi nun mixi fanyi tagi rasama. N benbae xa yunubi sare dɔxɔma e xa die xun ma han bɔnsɔɛ saxan, xa na mu naani.› <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Yandi, n bara i maxandi, diɲɛ i xa ɲama xa yunubi ma i xa hinnɛ xa fe ra, alɔ i a rabaxi kabi e mini Misira tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Alatala naxa a yaabi, «N bara diɲɛ i xa maxandi xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Kɔnɔ, n bara n kali, nɔndi nan a ra alɔ n to na na, alɔ n ma nɔrɛ naxan bɔxi rafema, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />xɛmɛ naxan birin n ma nɔrɛ nun n ma kaabanakoe toxi, n naxee raba Misira nun gbengberenyi ma, kɔnɔ e fa muruta n ma han sanya fu tuli xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />nee sese mu bɔxi toma, n naxan laayidixi e benbae bɛ. Naxan birin murutaxi n ma, e sese mu na toma. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Kɔnɔ n ma konyi di Kalebi to bira xaxili gbɛtɛ fɔxɔ ra, a fa n nabatu, n a tan nasoma nɛ na bɔxi ma, a naxan nabɛnxi. A bɔnsɔɛ kɛ sɔtɔma nɛ naa. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Amalɛkikae nun Kanaankae to sabati gulunba kui, tina wo xa wo mafindi, wo xa gbilen gbengberenyi ma Xulunyumi Baa mabiri.»<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa nun Haruna bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />«Yi ɲama kobi n matandima han mun tɛmui? N bara Isirayilakae xui mɛ, e naxan falama n bɛ, e ti n kanke. <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />A fala e bɛ, ‹N bara n kali, nɔndi nan a ra, alɔ n to na na, n a rabama nɛ wo bɛ alɔ n a mɛxi wo dɛ i ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Wo tan matandilae, naxan birin kɔntixi Isirayila ɲama ya ma, naxee xa simaya bara dangi ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, wo faxama nɛ yi gbengberenyi ma. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Wo mu soma bɔxi ma n naxan laayidi wo bɛ, fo Yefune xa di xɛmɛ Kalebi nun Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Wo xa die, wo naxee ma a e birin faxama gere nan kui, n nee tan nasoma nɛ na bɔxi kui, wo mɛɛxi naxan na. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Wo faxama gbengberenyi nan ma, wo furee luma na nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Wo xa die findima ɲɛrɛtie nan na ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma yi gbengberenyi ma. E wo xa yunubi sare xaninma han wo birin faxa gbengberenyi ma. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Wo xi xasabi naxan naba na bɔxi rabɛnde, wo na ɲɛ xasabi rabama gbengberenyi ma wo xa yunubi xa fe ra. Wo to xi tongo naani raba na bɔxi rabɛnde, wo fama nɛ ɲɛ tongo naani rabade gbengberenyi ma, alako wo xa a kolon n na yunubi xɔnxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />N tan Alatala, n bara gɛ wɔyɛnde. N bara na natɛ tongo yi ɲama kobi xa fe ra, naxan ti n kanke. E birin faxama nɛ gbengberenyi ma.›»<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Munsa xa xɛɛrae to gbilen kelife na bɔxi rabɛnde, e naxa fe xɔrɔxɔɛ fala na bɔxi xa fe ra han Isirayila ɲama naxa ti Munsa kanke. <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />Na kui, Alatala naxa e faxa keren na. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Na xɛɛrae ya ma, Yefune xa di xɛmɛ Kalebi nun Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe nan gbansan mu faxa.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Munsa to na masenyi ti Isirayila ɲama bɛ, e naxa sunnun ki fanyi. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />E naxa keli subaxɛ ma, e xa te geya longori. E naxɛ, «Muxu xa te yire, Alatala dɛnnaxɛ masenxi muxu bɛ. Muxu bara yunubi raba.» <verse eid="NUM 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Munsa naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo Alatala xa yaamari nan matandife? Wo mu geenima na kui. <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Wo naxa te de, barima Alatala mu na wo ya ma sɔnɔn. Wo naxa a niya wo yaxuie xa nɔ wo ra. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Amalɛkikae nun Kanaankae na wo ya ra, e wo sɔntɔma nɛ e xa santidɛgɛmae ra. Wo to bara wo kobe so Alatala ra, a mu na wo fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Kɔnɔ Isirayila ɲama mu e tuli mati Munsa ra. E naxa te geya yire, kɔnɔ Alatala xa saatɛ kankira nun Munsa mu keli ɲama xa yonkinde. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Amalɛkikae nun Kanaankae naxee nu sabatixi na geya yire, e naxa goro Isirayilakae xili ma, e fa e bɔnbɔ, e e masɛgɛ han Horoma.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Hadiya naxan sama sɛrɛxɛe fari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, ‹Wo na so bɔxi ma, n dɛnnaxan fixi wo ma sabatide ra, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />xa wo wama xuruse bafe sɛrɛxɛ ra naxan nafan Alatala ma, alɔ sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi, laayidi sɛrɛxɛ, sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi, xa na mu a ra sali sɛrɛxɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />wo xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ sa na fari, naxan findima sansi xɔri dinxi luxutaxi kilo saxan masunbuxi ture litiri keren nun a tagi ra, <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />a nun wɛni litiri keren nun a tagi. Na sama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi nan xun ma naxan findima yɛxɛɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />Xa a sa findi yɛxɛɛ kontonyi nan na, wo xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ sa na fari, naxan findima sansi xɔri dinxi luxutaxi kilo senni masunbuxi ture litiri firin na, <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />a nun wɛni litiri firin. Na ganxi rafan Alatala ma.›»<verse eid="NUM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />«Xa wo wama ninge bafe sɛrɛxɛ ra naxan nafan Alatala ma, alɔ sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi, laayidi sɛrɛxɛ, xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />wo xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ sa na fari, naxan findima sansi xɔri dinxi luxutaxi kilo solomanaani naxan masunbuxi ture litiri saxan na, <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />a nun wɛni litiri saxan. Na ganxi rafan Alatala ma.»<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />«Na nan nabama ningee, yɛxɛɛ kontonyie, yɛxɛɛe, nun sie birin bɛ wo naxan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Wo xa na raba xuruse birin bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Isirayilaka birin xa a raba na ki nɛ e xa sɛrɛxɛ birin bɛ, e naxan bama tɛ ra Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Xɔɲɛ naxee na wo ya ma, e fan xa a raba na ki e sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi bama tɛmui naxɛ. Na rafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Sɛriyɛ keren nan luma ɲama birin bɛ, Isirayilakae ba, xɔɲɛe ba. Keli wo tan ma, han wo xa die, nun nee fan xa die naxee fama, wo tan yo, xɔɲɛ yo, wo birin xa Alatala xa sɛriyɛ suxu na ki nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Isirayilakae ba, xɔɲɛe ba, wo birin na sɛriyɛ keren nun yaamari keren nan bun ma.»<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, ‹Wo na so bɔxi ma, n wo rasofe dɛnnaxɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />wo fa na bɔxi daxamui sɔtɔ, wo xa nde ba sɛrɛxɛ ra n bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Wo na taami singe yailan sansi xɔri nɛɛnɛ ra, wo xa nde ba sɛrɛxɛ ra n bɛ, alɔ wo sansi xɔri nɛɛnɛ nde bama ki naxɛ xɛ xaba tɛmui lonyi yire. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Wo xa na taami singe ba Alatala bɛ ɲɛ yo ɲɛ.›»<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yunubi ɲanigetare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />«Xa a sa li wo tantanxi nɛ Alatala xa yaamarie suxufe kui, a naxee masenxi Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />kelife na masen tɛmui, han wo xa die xa mamadie xa tɛmui, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />xa wo mu na raba wo ɲanige ra, wo a raba kolontareya kui, ɲama xa tuura ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, naxan nafan Alatala ma. Wo xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ sa na fari a raba ki ma, a nun sikɔtɛ naxan findima yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yunubi xafari maxandima nɛ Isirayilaka birin bɛ. Alatala diɲɛma nɛ e ma. Yunubi nan a ra, e mu naxan ɲanigexi. E man bara sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ba Alatala bɛ, a nun e xa yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Na yunubi xafarima nɛ Isirayilaka birin nun e xa xɔɲɛe bɛ, barima tantanyi na nu a ra.»<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />«Xa mixi keren nan yunubi raba ɲanigetareɲa kui, a xa si ginɛ keren ba yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxan bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yunubi xafari maxandima nɛ na mixi bɛ naxan yunubi raba ɲanigetareɲa kui Alatala ya xɔri. Na na ɲɔn, a xa yunubi bara xafari. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Na sɛriyɛ kerenyi na Isirayilakae nun e xa xɔɲɛe bɛ, yunubi rabafe ɲanigetareɲa xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />Kɔnɔ xa mixi nde sa Alatala matandi a ɲanige ra, a findi Isirayilaka ra, a findi xɔɲɛ ra, na kanyi kerima nɛ ɲama tagi. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />A bara Alatala xa masenyi mabere, a bara Alatala xa sɛriyɛ matandi. Na kanyi kerima nɛ ɲama tagi, barima na yunubi kote dɔxɔxi a xun ma.»<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malabui lɔxɔɛ kanafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Isirayilakae to nu na gbengberenyi ma, e naxa mixi nde li malabui lɔxɔɛ a yege fenfe. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />E naxa a xanin Munsa nun Haruna xɔn ɲama ya xɔri. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />E naxa a suxu, kɔnɔ e mu a ɲaxankata, barima natɛ mu nu tongoxi a xa fe ra sinden. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «Yi xɛmɛ lan nɛ a xa faxa. Ɲama birin xa a magɔnɔ han a faxa yonkinde fari ma.» <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Ɲama birin naxa a ramini e yonkinde fari ma, e a magɔnɔ han a faxa, alɔ Alatala a yamari Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosee xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, e tan nun e xa die xa mamadie e xa e xa sosee sanbunyi rafutufutu, e gɛsɛ gɛrɛ daaxi xiri a dɛ i. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Na sanbunyi rafutufutuxi findima tɔnxuma nan na wo bɛ, alako wo xa ratu Alatala xa yaamarie ma, wo man xa e rabatu. Wo naxa bira wo yɛtɛ waxɔnfee fɔxɔ ra, naxee wo ratantanma. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Na nan a niyama, wo ratuma n ma yaamarie ma, wo man e rabatu. Na kui, wo bara findi n ma mixie ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />N tan nan Alatala ra, wo Marigi Ala, naxan wo ramini Misira bɔxi ra, alako n xa findi wo Marigi Ala ra. N tan nan Alatala ra, wo Marigi Ala.»<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Kora Munsa matandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixi nde, naxan xili Kora, Yisehari xa di xɛmɛ, Kehati xa mamadi, a nun Datan nun Abirami, Eliyabi xa di xɛmɛe, a nun Peleta xa di xɛmɛ Oni, naxan fatanxi Ruben bɔnsɔɛ ra, <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />nee naxa ti Munsa kanke. Isirayilaka mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi tongo suuli nu na e xanbi ra. Kuntigi belebelee nu na e ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />E naxa e malan Munsa nun Haruna xili ma, e fa a fala e bɛ, «Wo xa mangɛya bara ɲɔn! Isirayila ɲama birin sɛniyɛn, Alatala man na muxu tagi. Munfe ra wo tan gbansan wo yɛtɛ itema Alatala xa ɲama xun ma?»<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Munsa to na mɛ, a naxa a yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />A naxa a fala Kora nun a xa mixie bɛ, «Tina gɛɛsɛgɛ, Alatala fama a masende won bɛ, a xa mixi sɛniyɛnxi na naxan na. A tinma na kanyi xa makɔrɛ a ra, a naxan sugandima. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Kora, i nun i xa mixie, wo xa surayi gansee tongo. <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />Tina wo tɛ sa e kui, wo surayi gan Alatala bɛ. Alatala na naxan sugandi, na nan sɛniyɛn. Lewi bɔnsɔɛ, yakɔsi wo bara a radangi a i.»<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Munsa man naxa a fala Kora bɛ, «Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa die, wo wo tuli mati. <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Isirayila Marigi Ala wo sugandixi nɛ Isirayila ɲama ya ma a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali xa fe ra. Wo tan nan tima ɲama ya ra e sali tɛmui. Na mu wo wasa? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />A tinma wo tan Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa makɔrɛ a ra, kɔnɔ wo wama sɛrɛxɛdubɛ wali fan nan nabafe. <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Na kui i tan nun i xa mixie, wo bara lan wo boore ma wo xa Alatala matandi. Munfe ra wo na tife Haruna kanke?»<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Munsa naxa mixi xɛɛ Eliyabi xa di xɛmɛe Datan nun Abirami xilide, kɔnɔ e naxa tondi, e fa a fala, «Muxu tan mu sigama. <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Munfe ra i bara muxu ramini bɔxi ma, kumi nun xiɲɛ xɛlɛma dɛnnaxɛ, alako muxu xa faxa yi gbengberenyi ma? I man wama i yɛtɛ findife muxu xa mangɛ ra? <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />I mu muxu rasoxi bɔxi kui kumi nun xiɲɛ xɛlɛma dɛnnaxɛ. I mu xɛe nun wɛni bilie xa fixi muxu ma kɛ ra. I ɲɔxɔ a ma, a i nun dɔnxuie nan a ra? Muxu mu sigama!» <verse eid="NUM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Munsa naxa xɔnɔ ki fanyi ra, a a fala Alatala bɛ, «I naxa e xa sɛrɛxɛ suxu. N mu sese tongoxi e yi ra, hali sofale keren. N mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi e ra.»<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Munsa naxa a fala Kora bɛ, «I tan nun i xa mixie, tina wo nun Haruna xa ti be Alatala ya i. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Wo birin xa wo xa surayi gansee tongo, wo xa surayi sa a ma, wo wo yɛtɛ masen Alatala bɛ. Na lanma surayi ganse kɛmɛ firin tongo suuli nan ma. I tan nun Haruna, wo fan xa wo xa surayi ganse suxu wo yi ra.» <verse eid="NUM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />E birin naxa tɛ sa e xa surayi gansee kui, e naxa surayi sa a ma, e fa ti hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra. Munsa nun Haruna fan nu na naa. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Kora to ɲama birin malan Munsa nun Haruna xili ma hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra, Alatala xa nɔrɛ naxa mini ɲama birin ma.<verse eid="NUM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa nun Haruna bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />«Wo mini yi mixie ya ma. N xa e sɔntɔ keren na!» <verse eid="NUM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Munsa nun Haruna naxa e yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, e fa a fala, «Alatala, Daali birin Mangɛ, a lanma i xa xɔnɔ ɲama birin ma, mixi keren xa yunubi xa fe ra?» <verse eid="NUM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Alatala naxa Munsa yaabi, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />«A fala ɲama birin bɛ, e xa e makuya Kora, Datan, nun Abirami xɔnyi ra.»<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Munsa nun Isirayila kuntigie naxa siga Abirami nun Datan yire. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />A naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo wo makuya yi yunubitɔɛe xa lingirae ra. Wo naxa din e xa see ra, alako wo naxa fa faxa e xa yunubie xa fe ra.» <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Ɲama naxa a masiga Kora, Datan, nun Abirami xa lingirae ra. Datan nun Abirami naxa mini e xɔnyi, e ti naadɛ ra, e nun e xa ginɛe, nun e xa die.<verse eid="NUM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Munsa naxa a fala, «Wo a kolonma a Alatala nan n tixi yi wali birin na, n tan mu a ra. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Xa yi mixie mu faxa kaabanakoe ra, Alatala mu n xɛɛxi. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Kɔnɔ xa Alatala sa kaabanako raba, a bɔxi rabi, e goro e ɲiɲɛ ra a kui, e tan nun e kɛ birin, na nan a masenma wo bɛ, a e bara Alatala mabere.»<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Munsa to gɛ na falade, bɔxi naxa rabi e sanyi bun ma, <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />a e gerun, Kora nun a xa mixie, e xa lingirae, a nun e xa harige birin. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />E naxa goro aligiyama e ɲiɲɛ ra, e tan nun e sɔtɔse birin. Bɔxi naxa e makoto, e naxa lɔɛ ɲama tagi. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Isirayilaka naxan birin nu na e sɛɛti ma, e naxa e gi e gbelegbele xui ma, e nu fa a fala, «Bɔxi naxa muxu fan gerun de!» <verse eid="NUM 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Alatala naxa tɛ radin na mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi tongo suuli ma, naxee surayi gan hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Ɲama rasɛniyɛnfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />«A fala Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di xɛmɛ Eleyasari bɛ, a xa surayi gansee matongo tɛ xɔɔra, a xa e tɛ wolee rawoli yire makuye. Na surayi gansee bara findi se sɛniyɛnxie ra Ala bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Wo xa na surayi gansee matongo, yunubitɔɛe naxee rawalixi e fa faxa, wo e bɔnbɔ han e xa findi a kebela ra, wo e sa sɛrɛxɛbade ma. Se sɛniyɛnxi na a ra barima a nu bara masen Alatala bɛ. Na kui a findi tɔnxuma nan na Isirayilakae bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa na mixie xa surayi ganse wure gbeeli daaxie matongo, na mixi faxaxie naxee rawalixi, a e bɔnbɔ han e findi kebela ra, a e sa sɛrɛxɛbade ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Na bara findi tɔnxuma ra Isirayilakae bɛ, alako e xa ratu a ma a mu lan mixi yo xa surayi gan sɛrɛxɛ ra bafe Haruna xa die, xa na mu a ra a fan luma nɛ alɔ Kora nun a xa mixie, alɔ Alatala a masenxi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Na kuye iba, Isirayila ɲama naxa wɔyɛn fɔlɔ Munsa nun Haruna ma, a e tan nan Alatala xa ɲama faxaxi. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />E nu e malanfe tɛmui naxɛ Munsa nun Haruna xili ma, e naxa a to nuxui naxa dusu hɔrɔmɔlingira xun ma, Alatala xa nɔrɛ fa mini e ma.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Munsa nun Haruna naxa siga hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />«Wo mini yi mixie ya ma, n xa e sɔntɔ kerenyi ra.» Munsa nun Haruna naxa e yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Munsa fa a fala Haruna bɛ, «I xa tɛ wole tongo sɛrɛxɛbade yire, i a sa i xa surayi ganse kui a nun surayi nde. Na xanin mafuren mafuren ɲama mabiri, i sa yunubi xafari maxandi e bɛ. Alatala bara a xa xɔnɛ fulun yi ɲama xili ma, sɔntɔɛ ɲan bara fɔlɔ.»<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Haruna naxa surayi ganse tongo alɔ Munsa a fala a bɛ ki naxɛ, a a gi a siga ɲama yire, sɔntɔɛ nu bara fɔlɔ dɛnnaxɛ. A naxa surayi ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, a fa yunubi xafari maxandi ɲama bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />A naxa ti mixi faxaxie nun mixi ɲiɲɛe tagi. Mixi faxafe naxa dan. <verse eid="NUM 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 17:14" />Mixi wulu fu nun naani mixi kɛmɛ solofere nan faxa, bafe Kora xa mixie ra, naxee singe faxa. <verse eid="NUM 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 17:15" />Mixi faxafe to dan, Haruna naxa gbilen Munsa yire hɔrɔmɔlingira dɛ ra.<verse eid="NUM 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haruna xa yisuxuwuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 17:16" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 17:17" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, bɔnsɔɛ xunyi birin xa yisuxuwuri keren so i yi ra, na lanma yisuxuwuri fu nun firin nan ma. I xa bɔnsɔɛ birin xili sɛbɛ a xa yisuxuwuri ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 17:18" />I xa Haruna xili sɛbɛ Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa yisuxuwuri ma. Bɔnsɔɛ xunyi birin xa yisuxuwuri xa lu naa. <verse eid="NUM 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 17:19" />I na yisuxuwurie sama hɔrɔmɔlingira nan kui, saatɛ kankira ya tode ra, n luma n yɛtɛ masen na wo bɛ dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 17:20" />N mixi naxan sugandixi, na kanyi xa yisuxuwuri mabutunma nɛ. Na kui, n bara a niya Isirayilakae naxa wɔyɛn wo ma sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="NUM 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 17:21" />Munsa naxa dɛntɛgɛ sa Isirayilakae bɛ. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xunyi birin naxa fa e xa yisuxuwuri ra. Na naxa lan yisuxuwuri fu nun firin ma. Haruna gbe nu na e ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 17:22" />Munsa naxa na yisuxuwurie sa Alatala ya i, hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, saatɛ kankira na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 17:23" />Na kuye iba, a to so hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, a naxa a to Haruna xa yisuxuwuri, naxan sa Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xili ra, a bara butun, a bara fuga, a tamare bogi gbeeli ramini. <verse eid="NUM 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 17:24" />Munsa naxa yisuxuwuri birin namini, a e masen Isirayila ɲama bɛ. Bɔnsɔɛ xunyi birin to e to, e naxa e gbe tongo.<verse eid="NUM 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 17:25" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «I man xa Haruna xa yisuxuwuri ragbilen saatɛ kankira yire, a xa ragata tɔnxuma ra matandilae bɛ. Na kui e mu wɔyɛnma n ma, e mu faxa.» <verse eid="NUM 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 17:26" />Munsa naxa Alatala xa yaamari rabatu, alɔ a masen a bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 17:27" />Isirayilakae naxa a fala Munsa bɛ, «A mato, muxu birin ɲɔnma nɛ halaki kui. <verse eid="NUM 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 17:28" />Naxan yo a maso Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ra, na kanyi faxama nɛ. Muxu birin xa sɔntɔ?»<verse eid="NUM 17:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Haruna bɛ, «I tan, i xa die, nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ birin, wo tan nan yunubi sɔtɔma xa fe ɲaaxi sa raba hɔrɔmɔlingira xa fe ra. Haruna i tan nun i xa die, wo tan nan yunubi sɔtɔma xa fe ɲaaxi sa raba sɛrɛxɛdubɛɲa xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />I xa Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixi birin maso i ra, alako e xa i tan nun i xa die mali wo xa wali ra hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />E i malima hɔrɔmɔlingira wali kui, kɔnɔ e naxa makɔrɛ yirabase sɛniyɛnxie nun sɛrɛxɛbade ra, alako wo naxa faxa, e tan nun i tan. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />E birama nɛ i fɔxɔ ra i xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali birin kui. Mixi gbɛtɛ yo naxa sunbu wo ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Wo tan gbansan xa sɛniyɛn lingira nun sɛrɛxɛbade wali raba, alako Alatala naxa fa a xa xɔnɛ ramini Isirayilakae ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />N tan nan wo ngaxakerenyi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tongoxi Isirayilakae ya ma n yɛtɛ bɛ. N bara e sa wo sagoe, e xa wo mali hɔrɔmɔlingira wali raba ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />I tan nun i xa die, wo ɲɔxɔ sama nɛ wo xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ wali xɔn ma sɛrɛxɛbade nun yire sɛniyɛnxi fisamante, naxan na dugi gbakuxi xanbi ra. N tan nan na wali fixi wo ma. Mixi gbɛtɛ na a maso na ra, a faxama nɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Alatala naxa a fala Haruna bɛ, «N bara Isirayilakae xa hadiya sɛniyɛnxi birin fi i tan nun i xa die ma, barima wo tan nan sugandixi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra abadan. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />See nan yi ki naxee findima i gbe ra se sɛniyɛnxie tagi, tɛ mu naxee ganxi: Isirayilakae xa sɛrɛxɛ, e xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛe, e xa yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛe, nun e xa yɛtɛ ragbilen sɛrɛxɛe. Na sɛrɛxɛ sɛniyɛnxie findima i tan nun i xa die nan gbe ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Wo nee donma nɛ alɔ se sɛniyɛnxie. Xɛmɛ birin nɔma e donde wo xa denbaya kui. Se sɛniyɛnxie nan e ra wo bɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />«Se naxee baxi Isirayilakae xa hadiya sɛniyɛnxie ra, n nee fan fima nɛ i ma, naxee lintanma n ya i a masenfe ra n gbe na a ra. N na fima i tan, i xa di xɛmɛe, nun i xa di ginɛe ma. I xa mixi birin naxee sɛniyɛnxi e nɔma na donde. <verse eid="NUM 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />N man bara daxamui singee fi i ma, Isirayilakae naxee bama n na hadiya ra alɔ ture, wɛni, nun sansi xɔrie dinxi. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Daxamui singee e fama naxan birin na n bɛ, na birin findima i gbe nan na. I xa mixi birin naxee sɛniyɛnxi e nɔma na donde.»<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />«Se naxan birin haramuxi mixie bɛ Isirayila bɔxi ma, a fa findi n gbe ra, n bara na fi i ma. <verse eid="NUM 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />Di singe birin naxee fima Alatala ma, a findi mixi ra, a findi xuruse ra, na birin i tan nan gbe a ra. Kɔnɔ ibunadama xa di xɛmɛ singe nun sube haramuxi xa di xɛmɛ singe, e tan xun sarama nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />E na kike keren sɔtɔ, e xun xa sara gbeti kole suuli, naxan kole keren lanma giramu fu ma.»<verse eid="NUM 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />«Kɔnɔ i naxa ningee, yɛxɛɛe, nun sie xa di singee xun sara, barima e tan sɛniyɛnxi. E wuli xa kasan sɛrɛxɛbade ma, e ture xa ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. E xa gan tɛ ra Alatala bɛ. Na rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />E ganyanyi nun e yirefanyi tabe findima i gbe nan na, barima e nu lintanxi n tan Alatala ya i sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />N bara nee fi i tan nun i xa die ma abadan, Isirayilaka naxan birin bama e xa sɛrɛxɛ sɛniyɛnxie ra Alatala bɛ. Saatɛ nan a ra naxan mu kanama abadan, i tan nun i bɔnsɔɛ birin bɛ Alatala ya i.»<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Alatala naxa a masen Haruna bɛ, «I mu kɛ sɔtɔma Isirayila bɔxi ma alɔ boore. N tan nan findima i kɛ ra Isirayilakae tagi. I hayi mu na sese gbɛtɛ ma.»<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />«N Isirayila xa farilɛ fima Lewi bɔnsɔɛ nan ma sare ra e xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Isirayilakae naxa e maso hɔrɔmɔlingira ra sɔnɔn, alako e naxa fa yunubi sɔtɔ na kui e faxama naxan ma. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ nan hɔrɔmɔlingira xa wali rabama. Xa yunubi yo sa mini na wali kui, e tan nan a kote tongoma. Na findima sɛriyɛ nan na wo bɛ abadan. Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mu fama kɛ sɔtɔde Isirayilakae tagi. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />N bara Isirayilakae xa farilɛ fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma kɛ ra. Na nan a toxi, n na a falaxi e xa fe ra, kɛ mu na e tan bɛ Isirayilakae tagi.»<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />«A fala Lewi bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, ‹Isirayilakae na fa e xa farilɛ ra, n naxan fima wo ma, wo xa na farilɛ xa farilɛ ba n tan bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Na kui wo fan a rabama nɛ alɔ wo ngaxakerenyi naxee farilɛ bama e xa sansi xɔri ra lonyi yire, xa na mu a ra e xa wɛni ra e a bunduma tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Wo xa wo xa hadiya ba n bɛ Isirayilakae xa farilɛ ra, wo fa a so Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Wo xa farilɛ ba n bɛ hadiya ra wo naxan birin sɔtɔma. Wo xa daxamui singee wo naxee sɔtɔma, wo xa n gbe ba na ra.› <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />I man xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Wo na gɛ daxamui fisamante bade n bɛ, wo xa na farilɛ ba sansi xɔri nun wɛni ra Lewi bɔnsɔɛ bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Wo tan nun wo xa denbayae nɔma na donde wo wama a xɔn dɛnnaxɛ. Wo xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali sare nan na ki. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Daxamui singee bafe mu findima yunubi ra wo bɛ. Wo mu Isirayilakae xa hadiya sɛniyɛnxie maberema na kui, wo man mu faxama na xa fe ra.›»<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Marasɛniyɛn ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa nun Haruna bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />«Ala xa sɛriyɛ nan ya. Isirayilakae xa fa ninge ginɛ gbeeli ra, naxan mu mabɛnxi, lanyuru mu na naxan ma, a nun naxan mu sari bɛndunxi sinden. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />I xa na so Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ yi ra, a kɔn fa raxaba a ya xɔri yonkinde fari ma. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Eleyasari xa a wuli nde kasan a bɛlɛxɛsole ra hɔrɔmɔlingira sode mabiri sanmaya solofere. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />E xa na ninge gundi birin gan a ya xɔri, a kiri, a sube, a wuli, nun a ɲaɲɛ. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Na ninge na ganfe tɛmui naxɛ, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa sɛdiri wuri nde, hisopi, nun gɛsɛ gbeeli woli tɛ xɔɔra.»<verse eid="NUM 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />«Na dangi xanbi, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa a fate nun a xa sosee maxa, a fa so yonkin yire, kɔnɔ a mu sɛniyɛnxi han nunmare. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Naxan bara ninge gan, na fan xa a fate nun a xa sosee maxa, kɔnɔ a mu sɛniyɛnxi han nunmare. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Mixi sɛniyɛnxi nde xa na ninge ganxi xube makɔ, a sa e sa yire sɛniyɛnxi yonkinde fari ma. A ragatama mɛnni nɛ Isirayila ɲama bɛ alako e xa marasɛniyɛn yɛ yailan a ra. Yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ nan a ra. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Naxan bara na ninge ganxi xube makɔ, na fan xa a fate nun a xa dugie xa, kɔnɔ a mu sɛniyɛnxi han nunmare. Na sɛriyɛ mu kanama abadan Isirayilakae nun e xɔɲɛe bɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />«Naxan na din mixi faxaxi ra, na kanyi findima sɛniyɛntare nan na xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />A xa a yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn yi marasɛniyɛn ye ra a xi saxan nde nun a xi solofere nde ma. Xa a mu a raba na xi saxan nde nun na xi solofere nde ma, a mu sɛniyɛnma. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Xa naxan yo din mixi faxaxi fure ra, a fa lu a mu a yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, na kanyi xa sɛniyɛntareɲa dangima nɛ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ma. Na kanyi xa keri Isirayilakae ya ma. Marasɛniyɛn ye to mu kasanxi a ma, a mu sɛniyɛnxi.»<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />«Sɛriyɛ nan ya: Xa mixi faxa kiri banxi nde kui, mixi yo naxan na naa, xa na mu a ra a soma naa, na kanyi findima mixi sɛniyɛntare nan na xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Sesase rabixi birin findima se sɛniyɛntare ra. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Mixi naxan din mixi faxaxi ra wula i, naxan bara faxa a ɲaaxi ra, xa na mu a faxa a yɛtɛ ma, na kanyi findima sɛniyɛntare nan na xi solofere bun ma. Naxan din mixi faxaxi xɔrie ra, xa na mu a gaburi ra, na fan mu sɛniyɛnxi xi solofere bun ma.»<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />«A lanma na mixi mɔɔli xa sɛniyɛn ye ra, naxan masunbuxi na ninge ganxi xube ra. Na ye xa tongo dulonyi yire, xa na mu a ra xure. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Xɛmɛ sɛniyɛnxi nde xa hisopi wuri salonyi tongo, a a rasin na ye xɔɔra, a a kasan na kiri banxi ma, a kui se birin ma, nun mixie ma naxee nu na a kui. E man xa na raba mixi ra naxan dinxi mixi fure ra, naxan faxa a ɲaaxi ra, xa na mu a ra naxan faxa a yɛtɛ ma, a nun mixi naxan dinxi mixi xɔrie ra, xa na mu gaburi ra. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Mixi sɛniyɛnxi xa na ye kasan mixi sɛniyɛntare ma a xi saxan nde nun a xi solofere nde. A na gɛ na ra, a xa a yɛtɛ nun a xa sosee maxa ye ra, a fa findi mixi sɛniyɛnxi ra na xi solofere nunmare ra.»<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />«Mixi naxan tondi a yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛnde, na kanyi xa keri ɲama ya ma, barima a xa sɛniyɛntareɲa dangima nɛ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ma. A to mu kasanxi marasɛniyɛn ye ra, a mu sɛniyɛnxi. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Yaamari nan na ki Isirayilakae bɛ naxan mu kanama abadan.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 19:21">«Marasɛniyɛn ye kasanma naxan ma, na kanyi xa a xa dugie xa. A mu sɛniyɛnma fo nunmare. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Mixi sɛniyɛntare dinma se naxan na, na se bara findi se sɛniyɛntare ra. Mixi naxan dinma na se ra, na fan findima mixi sɛniyɛntare nan na han nunmare.»<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Meriba ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Kike singe, Isirayila ɲama birin naxa so Sini gbengberenyi ma, e yonkin Kadesi. Mariyama naxa faxa mɛnni, e fa a ragata gaburi kui.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Ye to mu nu na ɲama yi ra, e naxa e malan Munsa nun Haruna xili ma. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />E naxa sɔnxɔ Munsa ra, e nu a fala, «A nu fisa muxu fan xa faxa Alatala muxu ngaxakerenyie faxa tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Munfe ra wo Alatala xa ɲama rafaxi yi gbengberenyi ma, muxu nun muxu xa xurusee xa faxa? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Munfe ra wo muxu raminixi Misira bɔxi ra fafe ra yi yire ɲaaxi, xɔrɛ bili, wɛni bili, girenadi wuri bili mu na dɛnnaxɛ. Hali ye min daaxi mu sɔtɔma be.»<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Munsa nun Haruna naxa keli ɲama ya ma, e e felen hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra. Alatala xa nɔrɛ naxa mini e ma. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />«I xa yisuxuwuri tongo. I tan nun i taara Haruna, wo xa Isirayilaka birin malan, wo wɔyɛn fanye ra e ya xɔri, alako a xa ye ramini. Wo ye raminima nɛ Isirayila ɲama bɛ alako e tan nun e xa xurusee xa ye min.» <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Munsa naxa a xa yisuxuwuri tongo naxan nu na hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, alɔ Alatala a yamari a bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Munsa nun Haruna naxa ɲama malan na fanye ya ra, e fa a fala e bɛ, «Wo tuli mati, wo tan matandilae. Muxu xa ye ramini wo bɛ yi fanye kui?» <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Munsa naxa a bɛlɛxɛ ite, a fanye bɔnbɔ sanya firin a xa yisuxuwuri ra. Ye naxa gbusan fanye ra, ɲama nun xuruse birin naxa e min.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Kɔnɔ Alatala naxa a masen Munsa nun Haruna bɛ, «Wo to mu laxi n na, Isirayila ɲama ya xɔri, wo xa binyɛ ti n tan Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ma, wo tan mu fama yi ɲama rasode na bɔxi ma n dɛnnaxɛ fixi e ma.» <verse eid="NUM 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />E mɛnni nan xili Meriba ye, barima Isirayilakae sɔnxɔ Alatala ma mɛnni nɛ, a fa a xa sɛniyɛnyi masen e bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edon mangɛ tondife Isirayila xa dangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Munsa naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Edon mangɛ ma keli Kadesi, a falafe ra a bɛ, «I ngaxakerenyi Isirayilakae xui nan ya! I a kolon muxu tɔɔrɔxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Muxu benbae goro nɛ Misira, muxu naxa ɲɛ wuyaxi raba mɛnni. Kɔnɔ Misirakae naxa muxu nun muxu benbae ɲaxankata. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Muxu naxa Alatala maxandi, a fa muxu xui ramɛ. A naxa a xa malekɛ xɛɛ muxu raminide Misira. Yakɔsi muxu na be Kadesi naxan na wo xa naaninyi ra. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />A lu muxu xa dangi wo xa bɔxi tagi. Muxu mu wo xa xɛe nun wo xa wɛni bilie kanama. Muxu mu ye bama wo xa kɔlɔnyie kui. Muxu mu sigama kɔɔla ma, muxu mu fama yirefanyi ma. Muxu tima wo xa kira xungbe kerenyi nan xɔn, han muxu dangima wo xa bɔxi ra tɛmui naxɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Edon mangɛ naxa a yaabi, «Wo mu dangima muxu xa bɔxi ra fefe ma, xa na mu muxu wo gerema santidɛgɛma nan na.»<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Isirayilakae man naxa a fala a bɛ, «Muxu tan dangima nɛ kira xɔn. Xa muxu nun muxu xa xurusee wo xa ye nde min, muxu xa a sare fi. Muxu mu i maxɔrinxi sese ma, muxu wama dangife nɛ tun.» <verse eid="NUM 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Edon mangɛ man naxa a yaabi, «Wo mu dangima feo!» Na kui, a naxa a xa sɔɔrie ramini a sɛnbɛ ki ma Isirayilakae ya ra. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Edon mangɛ to tondi Isirayilakae xa dangi a xa bɔxi ra, Isirayila naxa gbilen.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haruna faxafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Isirayila ɲama naxa keli Kadesi, e naxa siga Horo geya yire. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Alatala naxa a fala Munsa nun Haruna bɛ Horo geya yire, Edon xa bɔxi naaninyi ra, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />«Haruna fama nɛ a benbae lide aligiyama. A mu soma na bɔxi ma n dɛnnaxɛ fixi Isirayilakae ma, barima wo bara n ma yaamari matandi Meriba ye xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />I xa Haruna nun a xa di xɛmɛ Eleyasari xanin Horo geya fari. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Mɛnni i xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ dugie ba Haruna ma, i e ragoro a xa di xɛmɛ Eleyasari ma. Haruna laaxirama nɛ mɛnni, a fa a benbae yire li.» <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Munsa naxa a raba, alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ. E naxa te Horo geya fari Isirayilaka birin ya xɔri. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Munsa naxa Haruna xa donmae ba a ma, a e ragoro a xa di xɛmɛ Eleyasari ma. Haruna naxa laaxira geya fari. Munsa nun Eleyasari naxa goro geya ra, <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />e fa Isirayila ɲama rakolon Haruna faxa fe ra. Isirayila naxa a ɲɔn fe raba xi tongo saxan bun ma.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa gere singe gbengberenyi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Aradi mangɛ Kanaanka, naxan nu sabatixi Negewi bɔxi ma, a to a mɛ, a Isirayila nu minife Atarima kira nan na, a naxa e gere, a ndee findi geelimanie ra. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Na kui Isirayila naxa yi laayidi tongo Alatala bɛ, «Xa i yi mixie sa muxu sagoe, muxu e xa taa birin kanama nɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Alatala naxa tin Isirayilakae xa laayidi ra, a naxa Kanaankae sa e sagoe. Isirayilakae naxa e sɔntɔ, e e xa taae kana. Na nan a toxi e naxa mɛnni xili sa Horoma, naxan wama a falafe «gbaloe.»<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Isirayilakae naxa keli Horo geya ma Xulunyumi Baa kira xɔn ma, alako e xa Edon bɔxi mabilin. Kɔnɔ limaniya naxa ba e yi ra, <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />e fa a fala Alatala nun Munsa bɛ, «Munfe ra wo muxu raminixi Misira bɔxi ra, alako muxu xa fa faxa gbengberenyi ma? Taami mu na be, ye mu na be, fo yi donse ɲaaxi naxan goroma koore ma!»<verse eid="NUM 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Na kui Alatala naxa a niya bɔximasee xa mini e tagi, e xa mixie xin, e mixi gbegbe faxa. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Ɲama naxa a fala Munsa bɛ, «Muxu bara yunubi raba wɔyɛnfe ra i tan nun Alatala ma. I xa Alatala maxandi muxu bɛ, a xa yi bɔximasee makuya muxu ra.» Munsa naxa tin na ra, a Alatala maxandi ɲama bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Alatala naxa a yaabi, «Bɔximase misaali rafala wure gbeeli ra, a gbaku wuri kuye ra. Mixi xinxi naxan a ya tima na ra, a mu faxama.» <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Munsa naxa bɔximase yailan wure gbeeli ra, a a gbaku wuri kuye ra. Na tɛmui bɔximasee mixi naxee xinxi, e nu nɔma e ya tide na ra, e kisi.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Isirayilakae naxa siga, e sa yonkin Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />E naxa keli mɛnni, e siga Iye Abarimi gbengberenyi ma naxan ya rafindixi Mowaba bɔxi ma, sogetede mabiri. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Serede gulunba yire. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Arinon dɛ ra, xure naxan na Amori bɔxi ma. Arinon nan na naaninyi ra Mowabakae nun Amorikae tagi. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Na nan a ra, a sɛbɛxi sɛbɛli nde kui, Alatala xa geree xa fe na naxan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">«Wahebi nun a xa gulunbae na Sufa bɔxi ma,<verse eid="NUM 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />Arinon gulunbae gexi han Ari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">a findi Mowaba naaninyi nan na.»<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />E to keli, e naxa siga Beeri, Alatala a masen Munsa bɛ dɛnnaxɛ, «Ɲama malan, n xa e ki ye ra.» <verse eid="NUM 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Isirayilakae yi suuki ba na waxati nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">«Ye xa te kɔlɔnyi ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">Wo xa bɛɛti ba a xa fe ra!<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Mangɛe nun kuntigie bara a ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">mangɛ tɔnxuma kanyie.»<verse eid="NUM 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />E to keli gbengberenyi ma, e naxa siga Matana. E to keli Matana, e naxa siga Naxaliyɛli. E to keli Naxaliyɛli, e naxa siga Bamoti. <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />E to keli Bamoti, e naxa siga Mowaba gulunba yire, Pisiga geya na dɛnnaxɛ. Gbengberen yire birin toma nɛ na geya fari.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Isirayilakae naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Amorikae xa mangɛ Sixɔn yire a falafe ra, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />«Muxu wama girife i xa bɔxi nan ma. Muxu mu xɛ yire nun wɛni bogi yire lima. Muxu mu wo xa kɔlɔn ye minma. Muxu luma mangɛ xa kira gbansan nan xɔn ma, han muxu i xa bɔxi igiri.»<verse eid="NUM 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Sixɔn mu tin e xa dangi a xa bɔxi ma. A naxa a xa sɔɔrie malan, e naxa mini Isirayilakae xili ma gbengberenyi ma, e fa e gere Yahasi. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Isirayilakae naxa geeni. E naxa e xa bɔxi birin tongo keli Arinon xure ma han Yaboko xure, han Amonikae xa bɔxi naaninyi ra. E mu nɔ dangide na ra barima Amonikae sɛnbɛ nu gbo. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Kɔnɔ Isirayilakae naxa Amorikae xa taae birin suxu, e fa sabati nee kui. E naxa Xɛsibɔn fan suxu, a nun a xa rabilinyi. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Xɛsibɔn nan nu na Amorikae xa mangɛ Sixɔn xa mangataa ra. A nu bara na taa ba Mowaba mangɛ nde yi, a nun a xa bɔxi birin han Arinon xure.<verse eid="NUM 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Na nan a ra, bɛɛtibae a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">«Wo fa Xɛsibɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Sixɔn xa taa xa ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">a man xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ!<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Tɛ bara Xɛsibɔn gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Sixɔn xa taa bara kana tɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Mowaba bɔxi xa taa Ari fan bara gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">naxan xa mixie nu nɔma Arinon tode.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Ɲaxankatɛ na wo bɛ Mowabakae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">wo tan Kemosi xa batulae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">A xa di xɛmɛe bara e gi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">A xa di ginɛe bara findi geelimanie ra Amori mangɛ Sixɔn xɔnyi.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Kɔnɔ muxu bara nɔ e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Xɛsibɔn bara kana han Dibon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Muxu bara e halaki han Nofa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">han a sa Medeba li.»<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Isirayila naxa sabati Amorikae xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Munsa to gɛ Yaasɛri taa rabɛnde, Isirayila naxa Amorikae keri na longori birin ma. <verse eid="NUM 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Na dangi xanbi, e naxa kira tongo sigafe ra Basan. Basan mangɛ Ogo nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa e li Edereyi. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «I naxa gaaxu a ya ra! N na sama nɛ i bɛlɛxɛ, a nun a xa sɔɔrie nun a xa bɔxi birin. I xa a bɔnbɔ alɔ i Amori mangɛ Sixɔn bɔnbɔxi ki naxɛ Xɛsibɔn.» <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Isirayilakae naxa Ogo, a xa die, nun a xa sɔɔri birin bɔnbɔ. Mixi keren mu nɔ a bade e yi. E naxa a xa bɔxi findi e gbe ra.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Balaki xa xɛɛraya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Isirayilakae naxa siga e sa yonkin Mowaba fiili ma, Yurudɛn xure dɛ, Yeriko ya tagi. <verse eid="NUM 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Siporo xa di xɛmɛ Balaki nu bara a mɛ Isirayilakae naxan nabaxi Amorikae ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Mowabakae nu bara gaaxu Isirayila ɲama belebele xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Na kui, e naxa a fala Madiyan kuntigie bɛ, «Yi ɲama belebele fama won ma bɔxi birin xun nakanade, alɔ ningee mɛrɛ xun nakanama ki naxɛ.» Balaki nan nu na Mowaba mangɛ ra na tɛmui.<verse eid="NUM 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />A naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Beyori xa di xɛmɛ Balami yire, naxan nu sabatixi Petori, a bari taa xure dɛ ra, a falafe ra, «Ɲama belebele nde bara keli Misira bɔxi ma, e fa yonkin n ma bɔxi sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Yandi, i xa fa yi ɲama dankade, barima e sɛnbɛ gbo n bɛ. Tɛmunde, na ki n nɔma nɛ e bɔnbɔde, n e keri yi bɔxi ma. N a kolon, i na duba naxan bɛ, na bara baraka. I man na naxan danka, na fan bara danka.» <verse eid="NUM 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Mowaba kuntigie nun Madiyan kuntigie naxa siga se matoe sare ra Balami xɔn, e fa Balaki xa xɛɛraya iba a bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Balami naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo xa kɔɛ radangi be. Alatala na yaabi so n yi, n na falama nɛ wo bɛ.» Na kui, Mowaba kuntigie naxa xi Balami xɔnyi. <verse eid="NUM 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Alatala naxa mini Balami ma, a a maxɔrin, «Nde na yi mixie ra i naxee rasɛnɛxi i xɔnyi yi ki?» <verse eid="NUM 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Balami naxa a yaabi, «Mowaba mangɛ Siporo xa di xɛmɛ Balaki nan yi mixie xɛɛ, a e xa fa a fala n bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />‹Ɲama belebele nde bara keli Misira bɔxi ma, e fa sabati n ma bɔxi sɛɛti ma. I xa fa yi ɲama danka, alako n xa nɔ e keride.›» <verse eid="NUM 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Alatala naxa a masen Balami bɛ, «I naxa bira yi mixie fɔxɔ ra, i naxa na ɲama danka. Barakatɔɛ ɲama na a ra.»<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Na kuye iba Balami naxa keli, a a fala Balaki xa kuntigie bɛ, «Wo gbilen wo xa bɔxi ma, barima Alatala mu tinxi n xa bira wo fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="NUM 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Na kui, Mowaba kuntigie naxa gbilen Balaki yire, e a fala a bɛ, «Balami bara tondi birade muxu fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Balaki man naxa kuntigi gbegbe gbɛtɛ xɛɛ, naxee tide dangi a singee ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />E naxa siga Balami yire, e a fala a bɛ, «Balaki xa masenyi nan ya: ‹N tan Siporo xa di xɛmɛ Balaki, n bara i mayandi, i naxa tondi talufe ra n yire! <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />N i sare fima nɛ a fanyi ra. I wama naxan yo xɔn, n na fima nɛ i ma. Yandi i xa yi ɲama danka n bɛ.›» <verse eid="NUM 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Kɔnɔ Balami naxa Balaki xa xɛɛrae yaabi, «Hali Balaki a xa banxi rafe gbeti nun xɛɛma ra, a a so n yi ra, n mu nɔma fefe rabade n Marigi Alatala mu n yamari naxan na. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Wo naxan nabama, wo fan xa lu be han tina gɛɛsɛgɛ. N man xa Alatala xa masenyi ramɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Alatala naxa mini Balami ma kɔɛ ra, a a masen a bɛ, «Yi mixie to bara fa i xilide, i xa bira e fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ n na naxan fala i bɛ, i na nan nabama.»<verse eid="NUM 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Na kuye iba Balami naxa baki a xa sofale fari, a bira Mowaba kuntigie fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Balami sigafe naxa Alatala raxɔnɔ. Alatala xa malekɛ naxa siga kira ibolonde Balami ya ra. A nu dɔxɔxi a xa sofale fari, a xa walikɛ firinyie nu na a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Balami xa sofale to Alatala xa malekɛ to kira tagi, santidɛgɛma suxuxi a yi, a raminixi a tɛ i, a naxa keli kira xɔn ma, a so xɛ ra. Balami naxa sofale bɔnbɔ, alako a xa a xun ti kira ra.<verse eid="NUM 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Alatala xa malekɛ man naxa sa ti e xa kira di xɔn ma wɛni bilie tɛtɛ firinyie tagi. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Sofale to Alatala xa malekɛ to, a naxa a raxɛtɛn tɛtɛ ra, a Balami sanyi xɛtɛn tɛtɛ ra a ɲaaxi ra. Balami naxa gbilen a bɔnbɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Alatala xa malekɛ man naxa sa ti yire raxɛtɛnxi a fanyi ra. Dangide yo mu nu na. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Sofale to Alatala xa malekɛ to, a naxa a sa Balami bun ma. Balami naxa xɔnɔ a ma, a a bɔnbɔ a xa yisuxuwuri ra.<verse eid="NUM 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Na kui, Alatala naxa sofale dɛ ramini, a a niya a xa a fala Balami bɛ, «A saxan nde nan yi ki i n bɔnbɔma. N munse rabaxi i ra?» <verse eid="NUM 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balami naxa a yaabi, «I n matandixi nɛ. Xa santidɛgɛma na n yi ra nu, n i faxama nɛ keren na.» <verse eid="NUM 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Sofale naxa a fala Balami bɛ, «N tan xa mu i xa sofale ra, i tema naxan fari tɛmui birin? N darixi yi mɔɔli raba ra?» Balami naxa a yaabi, «Ade.»<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa Balami ya rabi malekɛ tofe ra, a tixi kira tagi, a xa santidɛgɛma baxi a tɛ i, a suxuxi a bɛlɛxɛ. Balami naxa a felen, a suyidi keren na. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Malekɛ naxa a maxɔrin, «Munfe ra i bara i xa sofale bɔnbɔ sanya saxan? N faxi nɛ n xa kira ibolon i ya ra, barima i na kira naxan xɔn yi ki, murutɛla xa kira na a ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />I xa sofale bara i ratanga n ma sanya saxan. Xa a tan mu a ra nu, n bara i faxa nu, kɔnɔ n mu a tan faxama.» <verse eid="NUM 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Balami naxa a fala a bɛ, «N bara yunubi raba! N mu nu a kolonxi, i tixi n ya ra. Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, xa yi biyaasi mu i kɛnɛnxi, n xa gbilen n xɔnyi.» <verse eid="NUM 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Alatala xa malekɛ naxa a masen, «Ade, i xa bira yi mixie fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ n na masenyi naxan masen i bɛ, i na nan falama.» Na kui, Balami nun Balaki xa xɛɛrae naxa siga.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Balaki to a mɛ a Balami na fafe, a naxa siga a ralande taa nde ma Arinon xure dɛ ra, Mowaba xa naaninyi yire. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />A naxa Balami maxɔrin, «Munfe ra i mu fa n ma xɛɛraya singe xili ma? I ɲɔxɔ a ma n mu nɔma i sare fide?» <verse eid="NUM 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Balami naxa Balaki yaabi, «N bara fa i xɔn, kɔnɔ n mu nɔma wɔyɛnde na ki tun. Alatala masenyi naxan sama n dɛ i, n na nan tun falama.» <verse eid="NUM 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Balami nun Balaki naxa siga, e so Kiriyati Xusoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Balaki naxa ningee nun yɛxɛɛe ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, a nde so Balami yi ra a nun kuntigi naxee nu na a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Na kuye iba, Balaki naxa Balami xanin Bamoti Baali geya fari. Mɛnni a naxa Isirayila ɲama sɛɛti nde to.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="s">Balami dubafe Isirayila ɲama bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balami naxa a fala Balaki bɛ, «I xa sɛrɛxɛbade solofere yailan be. I man xa fa tuura solofere nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi solofere ra.» <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balami naxan maxɔrin, Balaki naxa a birin naba. E naxa tuura keren nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren ba sɛrɛxɛ ra na sɛrɛxɛbade keren keren ma. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Balami naxa a fala Balaki bɛ, «I xa lu be sɛrɛxɛ fɛ ma, n tan xa n makuya dondoronti. Tɛmunde Alatala fama minide n ma. A naxan yo masen n bɛ, n a falama i bɛ.» Balami to te geya nde fari, <verse eid="NUM 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Alatala naxa mini a ma. Balami naxa a fala a bɛ, «N bara sɛrɛxɛbade solofere yailan, n yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren nun tuura keren nan baxi a birin keren keren fari.» <verse eid="NUM 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Alatala naxa masenyi fi Balami ma a naxan masenma. A naxa a yita a bɛ, «Siga Balaki yire, i xa yi masenyi ti a bɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Balami naxa gbilen Balaki yire, a a li a tixi a xa sɛrɛxɛ fɛ ma, a tan nun Mowaba kuntigie. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Balami naxa a xa masenyi ti yi ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">«Balaki nan faxi n na kelife Siriya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Mowaba mangɛ nan n xilixi, kelife sogetede geyae kɔn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">‹Fa, Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ danka n bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">I xa xɔnɛ radin Isirayila ma!›<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />N nɔma mixi dankade di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Alatala mu naxan dankaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">N nɔma xɔnɔde mixi ma di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Ala mu xɔnɔxi naxan ma?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />N e toma kelife geya kɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">keli yire itexi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Ɲama nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">naxan luma a xati ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">naxan tagi rasama e nun si gbɛtɛe ra.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Nde nɔma Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ kɔntide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">kɔnti naxan dangima mɛyɛnyi kɔnti ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">E nu Isirayila ɲama itaxun dɔxɔde naani ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">nde nɔma a sɛɛti keren yati kɔntide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Ala xa n mali n xa aligiyama li tinxinyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Ala xa n mali n xa maniya e ra n ma saya kui.»<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Balaki naxa a fala Balami bɛ, «I munse rabaxi n na yi ki? N i rafaxi nɛ n yaxuie dankade, kɔnɔ i tan na dubafe e bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Balami naxa a yaabi, «Alatala na masenyi naxan sa n dɛ i, n mu lan n xa na fala?»<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Balaki man naxa a fala a bɛ, «Won xa siga yire gbɛtɛ, i nɔma e tode dɛnnaxɛ. I sɛɛti keren nan gbansan toma be, i mu e birin toma. Mɛnni i nɔma e birin tode, i fa e danka.» <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />A naxa Balami xanin Sofimi, Pisiga geya fari. A naxa sɛrɛxɛbade solofere yailan mɛnni, a tuura keren nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren ba sɛrɛxɛ ra na sɛrɛxɛbade keren keren ma fari. <verse eid="NUM 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Balami naxa a fala Balaki bɛ, «I xa lu be i xa sɛrɛxɛ fɛ ma, n tan xa n makuya dondoronti, n nun Alatala xa lu yire keren.»<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Alatala naxa mini Balami ma, a masenyi nde fi a ma, a fa a fala a bɛ, «Siga Balaki yire, i xa yi masenyi ti a bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Balami naxa gbilen Balaki yire, a a li a tixi a xa sɛrɛxɛ fɛ ma, a tan nun Mowaba kuntigie. Balaki naxa a maxɔrin, «Alatala munse masenxi?» <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Balami naxa yi masenyi ti a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">«Balaki, keli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">Siporo xa di xɛmɛ, i tuli mati.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Ala mixi mu a ra, a mu wule falama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Adamadi mu a ra, a xa a xaxili masara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">A mu a xui masarama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">A mu nɛɛmuma a xa saatɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">A mu laayidi kanama.<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Ala bara n yamari n xa duba yi ɲama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">Alatala bara baraka sa e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">N mu nɔma na masarade.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Tɔɔrɛ mu luma Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Setareɲa mu toma Isirayila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">E Marigi Alatala na e fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Mangɛ xui mɛma nɛ e tagi.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Alatala e raminixi Misira bɔxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">sɛnbɛ na e yi ra alɔ sɛxɛ ninge.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Karamɔxɔ wali mu nɔma Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ tɔɔrɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Sematoe mu nɔma sese rabade Isirayila xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">A fama falade Yaxuba nun Isirayila xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Ala xa wali mato!<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Yi ɲama kelima alɔ yɛtɛ ginɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">e tima alɔ yɛtɛ xɛmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">naxan mu a sama fo a xa sube don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">a naxan faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">fo a xa a wuli min.»<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Balaki naxa a fala Balami bɛ, «Xa i mu wama e dankafe, hali i mu duba e bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Balami naxa a yaabi, «N mu a fala i bɛ, Alatala na naxan yo masen n bɛ, n na nan falama?»<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Balaki naxa a fala Balami bɛ, «Awa, won xa siga yire gbɛtɛ. Tɛmunde Alatala tinma i xa yi ɲama danka n bɛ mɛnni.» <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Balaki naxa Balami xanin Peyori geya fari, gbengberenyi toma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Balami naxa a fala Balaki bɛ, «Sɛrɛxɛbade solofere ti be, i man xa fa tuura solofere nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi solofere ra.» <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balami naxan maxɔrin, Balaki naxa a birin naba. A naxa tuura keren nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren ba sɛrɛxɛ ra na sɛrɛxɛbade keren keren ma fari.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="s">Balami dubafe Isirayila bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Balami to a to a Alatala nu wama baraka safe Isirayila xa fe ma, a mu karamɔxɔ wali raba alɔ a darixi a raba ra ki naxɛ. A naxa a ya rafindi gbengberenyi ma. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />A to Isirayila ɲama to, e yonkinxi e bɔnsɔɛ ki ma, Ala Xaxili naxa goro a ma, <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />a fa yi masenyi ti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">«N yi nan masenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">n tan Beyori xa di xɛmɛ Balami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">naxan xa se igbɛma a fanyi ra,<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />naxan Ala xui ramɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">naxan Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi xa laamatunyi toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">naxan fahaamui sɔtɔma suyidi kui.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Yaxuba, i xa kiri banxie rayabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">Isirayila, i xa lingirae tofan.<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />E gulunba rafema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">e luma alɔ laakɔɛ naxan na xure dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">alɔ wuri bilie Alatala naxee sixi ye yire.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Ye mu ɲɔnma Isirayila ɲama yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">tunɛ goroma e xa sansie ma a fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">E xa mangɛ sɛnbɛ gbo Agaga bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Isirayila xa mangɛya xili fanyi sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Ala naxa e ramini Misira bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">e sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ sɛxɛ ninge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">E e yaxuie xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">naxee e xɔri girama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">e e faxama xalie ra.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />E e malabuma nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">nde suusama e rakelide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Baraka xa lu mixi bɛ naxan na duba wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">danka xa lu mixi bɛ naxan na wo danka!»<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Na kui Balaki naxa xɔnɔ Balami ma a ɲaaxi ra. A naxa a fala, «N i xili nɛ i xa n yaxuie danka, kɔnɔ a sanya saxan nde nan yi ki, i na dubafe e bɛ! <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Keli be keren na! Siga i xɔnyi! N nu bara laayidi tongo i bɛ wali sare xa fe ra, kɔnɔ Alatala mu tinxi i xa a sɔtɔ!» <verse eid="NUM 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balami naxa a yaabi, «N mu a fala i xa xɛɛrae bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />‹Hali Balaki a xa banxi nan nafe gbeti nun xɛɛma ra n bɛ, n mu nɔma sese rabade Alatala mu n yamari naxan na. Alatala naxan masenma n bɛ, n nɔma gbilende na fɔxɔ ra?› <verse eid="NUM 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Awa, yakɔsi, n na gbilenfe n xɔnyi, kɔnɔ i xa a kolon yi ɲama naxan nabama wo ra.»<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Na tɛmui Balami naxa yi masenyi ti a bɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">«Beyori xa di xɛmɛ Balami xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">naxan see igbɛma a fanyi ra,<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />naxan Ala xui ramɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">naxan Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi xa laamatunyi toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">naxan fahaamui sɔtɔma Ala Xili Xungbe saabui ra.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />N fe toxi naxan fama rabade yare.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">N fe toxi naxan makuya yakɔsi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Tunbui nde fama tede kelife Yaxuba xa mixie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Mangɛ tɔnxuma nde fama kelide Isirayila ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">A Mowaba xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">a Seti xa die xa fe ɲɔnma nɛ.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Edon xa fe goroma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Seyiri xa fe goroma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">kɔnɔ Isirayila sɛnbɛ sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Mangɛ nde kelima Yaxuba xa mixie ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">naxan bekae sɔntɔma.»<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Balami to Amalɛkikae to, a naxa yi masenyi ti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">«Amalɛki si fisamante na nu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi, a bɔnɔma nɛ!»<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Balami to Kenikae to, a naxa yi masenyi ti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">«Wo sabatide mabanbanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">wo tɛɛ saxi fanye nan fari,<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />kɔnɔ Asuri fama nɛ wo xun nakanade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">a wo findi geelimanie ra.»<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Na tɛmui a naxa a xa masenyi xun dusu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">«Nde nɔma kiside Ala xa ɲaxankatɛ ma?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Kunkuie fama nɛ kelife Kitimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">e nɔma nɛ Asuri nun Xeberi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi, e fan xun nakanama nɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Na dangi xanbi, Balami naxa keli, a gbilen a xɔnyi. Balaki fan naxa keli naa.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae xa kuye batui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Isirayilakae to nu yonkinxi Sitimi, e naxa so yɛnɛ rabafe Mowaba ginɛe ra. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Na ginɛe naxa Isirayila xɛmɛe xili e xa lan e xa sɛrɛxɛe ma, naxee nu bama e xa kuyee bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Isirayilakae to Peyori xa Bali kuye batu fɔlɔ, Alatala naxa xɔnɔ e ma. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Alatala naxa a fala Munsa bɛ, a a xa ɲama yarerati birin gbaku wuri kɔn na a ya i, a e ya rafindi soge ma, alako a xa xɔnɛ xa gbilen Isirayila fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Munsa naxa Isirayila kiitisae yamari, «Wo xa mixi birin faxa, naxan bara Peyori xa Bali kuye batu!»<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />A fɛfɛ na fala, Isirayilaka nde naxa fa Madiyanka ginɛ nde ra a ngaxakerenyie ya i. Munsa nun Isirayila ɲama naxee nu na wafe hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra, naxa na ginɛ nun na xɛmɛ to. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Haruna xa mamadi, Eleyasari xa di xɛmɛ Finexasi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ to na ginɛ nun na xɛmɛ to, a naxa keli, a tanbɛ tongo, <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />a bira na xɛmɛ fɔxɔ ra kiri banxi kui, a sa a tan nun na ginɛ sɔxɔ a xa tanbɛ ra e furi ma keren na. Na tɛmui Alatala xa xɔnɛ naxa dan. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nan faxa na gbaloe kui.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />«Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa mamadi, Eleyasari xa di xɛmɛ Finexasi, bara n ma xɔnɛ ba Isirayilakae ma. N ma xanunteya n ma ɲama bɛ nu na a bɔɲɛ kui, a fa a niya a xa na raba. N tan mu Isirayila birin sɔntɔ n ma xanunteya xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />A fala Finexasi bɛ, n bara bɔɲɛsa saatɛ xiri a tan nun n tan tagi. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Na saatɛ luma n tan nun a bɔnsɔɛ tagi, e fa findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra abadan, barima n ma xanunteya nu na a bɔɲɛ kui, a man fa a niya Isirayilakae xa yunubi xa xafari.»<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Isirayilaka naxan faxa e nun na Madiyan ginɛ ra, a nu xili Simiri, Salu xa di xɛmɛ. Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xunyi nde nan nu a ra. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Na ginɛ Madiyanka tan nu xili Kɔsibi, Suuru xa di ginɛ. Madiyan xabilɛ ndee xunyi nan nu a baba ra. <verse eid="NUM 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />«Wo xa Madiyankae gere alɔ yaxuie! <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />E findixi wo bɛ yaxuie nan na Peyori kuye xa fe ra, nun e maaginɛ Kɔsibi xa fe ra. Kɔsibi findixi e xa yarerati nde xa di ginɛ nan na, <verse eid="NUM 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 25:19" />naxan faxa Peyori kuye xa fe kui.»<verse eid="NUM 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae kɔntife a firin nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Na gbaloe to dangi, Alatala naxa a fala Munsa nun Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di xɛmɛ Eleyasari bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />«Wo xa Isirayila ɲama birin xili sɛbɛ, keli a ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn ma han na xanbi, a denbaya ki ma, naxan birin nɔma sɔɔriɲa rabade.» <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Munsa nun Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa a fala Isirayilakae bɛ Mowaba bɔxi ma Yurudɛn xure sɛɛti ma Yeriko ya i, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />«Isirayilaka birin xa kɔnti, keli mixi ma naxan bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn sɔtɔ han na xanbi, alɔ Alatala a yamari Munsa nun Isirayilakae bɛ ki naxɛ.» Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ naxee mini Misira bɔxi ra, nee nan yi ki.<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />A fɔlɔ Isirayila xa di singe Ruben nan ma, a xa die nan yi ki: Xanɔki, Palu, <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />Xesiron, Karimi, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe nan na ki. Nee xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo naani nun saxan kɛmɛ solofere tongo saxan nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Palu xa di xɛmɛ Eliyabi <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />nan nu na Nemuweli, Datan, nun Abirami baba ra, naxee keli Munsa nun Haruna xili ma Isirayila kuntigie ya ma. E nun Kora nun a fɔxirabirɛe to keli Alatala xili ma, <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />bɔxi rabi nɛ, a fa e birin gerun. Na lɔxɔɛ Alatala mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi tongo suuli gan nɛ tɛ ra, e xa findi misaali ra ɲama bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Kɔnɔ Kora xa die tan mu faxa na fe kui.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Simeyɔn xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Nemuweli, Yamin, Yakimi, <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Sera, Sawulu, a nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe nan na ki. Nee xasabi lan mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin, mixi kɛmɛ firin nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Gadi xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Sefon, Xagi, Suni, <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Oseni, Eri, <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />Arodi, Areli, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Gadi bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe nan na ki. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo naani, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Yuda xa die nan yi ki: Eru nun Onan. Kɔnɔ e tan faxa Kanaan bɔxi nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Yuda xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Selaha, Peresi, Sera, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Peresi xa die nan yi ki: Xesiron, Xamuli, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe nan na ki. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo solofere nun senni, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Isakari xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Tola, Puwa, <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />Yasubu, Simiron, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Isakari bɔnsɔɛe nan na ki e xabilɛ ki ma. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo senni nun naani, mixi kɛmɛ saxan nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Sabulon xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Seredi, Elon, Yaxaleeli, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe nan na ki. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo senni, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Yusufu xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Manasi nun Efirami. <verse eid="NUM 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Manasi xa die nan yi ki: Makiri nun a xabilɛe. Makiri nan Galadi nun a xabilɛe sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Galadi xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Yeseri, Xeleki, <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />Asirɛli, Sikemi, <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />Sɛmida, Xeferi, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Xeferi xa di xɛmɛ Selofexadi tan di ginɛe nan tun sɔtɔ. Nee xilie nan yi ki: Maxala, Nowa, Xogala, Milika nun Tirisa. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe nan na ki. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo suuli nun firin, mixi kɛmɛ solofere nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Efirami xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Sutela, Bekeri, Taxani, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Sutela xa di nan yi ki: Eran nun a xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Efirami xa die nan na ki. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo saxan nun firin, mixi kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. Yusufu xa mamadie nan na ki e xabilɛ ki ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Bunyamin xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Bela, Asibeli, Axirama, <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />Sufami, Xufami, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Bela xa die naxa findi Arade, Naaman, nun e xabilɛe ra. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Bunyamin xa die nan na ki e xabilɛ ki ma. E xasabi naxa lan mixi wulu tongo naani nun mixi suuli kɛmɛ senni ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Dana xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma. Suxami nun a xabilɛe. Dana bɔnsɔɛ nan na ki e xabilɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />E xasabi naxa lan mixi wulu tongo senni nun naani, mixi kɛmɛ naani ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Aseri xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Yimena, Yisiwi, Beriya, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Beriya xa die nan yi ki: Xeberi, Malakiyeli, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Aseri xa di ginɛ nu xili nɛ Sera. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Aserikae nan na ki e xabilɛ ki ma. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo suuli nun saxan, mixi kɛmɛ naani nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Nafatali xa die nan yi ki e xabilɛ ki ma: Yaxaseeli, Guni, <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />Yeseri, Silemi, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Nafatali bɔnsɔɛe nan na ki e xabilɛ ki ma. E xasabi lan mixi wulu tongo naani nun suuli, mixi kɛmɛ naani nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Isirayilaka kɔnti lanxi mixi wulu kɛmɛ senni nun keren, mixi kɛmɛ solofere tongo saxan nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />«Kanaan bɔxi itaxunma na mixie nan ma e bɔnsɔɛ xasabi ma, a findi e kɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Bɔnsɔɛ birin kɛ sɔtɔma a xa mixie xasabi bɛrɛ nan na. Bɔnsɔɛ naxee xa mixie gbo, i nee gbe ragbo dangi booree ra, naxee xa mixi xurun. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />N tan nan a ragirima bɔnsɔɛ birin lan a xa kɛ naxan sɔtɔ e bɔnsɔɛ xasabi ma. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Bɔxi itaxunyi findima Ala xa maragiri nan na, bɔnsɔɛ xungbee nun bɔnsɔɛ xurie tagi.»<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ nan yi ki naxee kɔnti e xabilɛ ki ma: Gerison, Kehati, Merari, nun e xabilɛe. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe nan yi ki: Libini, Xebiron, Maxali, Musi, nun Kora. Kehati nu bara Amarama sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Amarama xa ginɛ nu xili nɛ Yebedi, Lewi xa di ginɛ, naxan bari Misira. A naxa Haruna, Munsa, nun e maaginɛ Mariyama bari Amarama bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Haruna nu bara Nadabo, Abihu, Eleyasari, nun Itamari sɔtɔ di ra. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Nadabo nun Abihu faxa nɛ, e to sɛrɛxɛ gan tɛ ra naxan mu daxa. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Di xɛmɛ naxan kɔnti Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, keli a kike keren ma han na xanbi, a xasabi lan mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan nan ma. E xa kɔnti nu na a xati ma, barima e mu bɔxi sɔtɔ kɛ ra Isirayilakae ya ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Munsa nun Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ na mixie nan kɔnti Mowaba bɔxi ma Yurudɛn xure sɛɛti ma Yeriko taa ya i, <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />kɔnɔ Munsa nun Haruna sɛrɛxɛdubɛ mixi naxee kɔnti Turusinina gbengberenyi ma, na keren mu nu na Isirayilakae ya ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Alatala a fala nɛ, a nee birin faxama nɛ gbengberenyi ma. Na kui, e sese mu lu duniɲa, fo Yefune xa di xɛmɛ Kalebi, nun Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛe xa kɛ sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Yusufu xa di xɛmɛ Manasi, na fan xa di xɛmɛ Makiri, na fan xa di xɛmɛ Galadi, na fan xa di xɛmɛ Xeferi, na fan xa di xɛmɛ Selofexadi, di ginɛ suuli nan sɔtɔ, naxee nu xili: Maxala, Nowa, Xogala, Milika nun Tirisa. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Na di ginɛe nan fa e yɛtɛ kan dɛntɛgɛ Munsa, Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, nun Isirayila yareratie bɛ, Isirayila ɲama birin ya xɔri, hɔrɔmɔlingira sode dɛ ra. E naxa a masen, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />«Muxu baba mu di xɛmɛ sɔtɔ. A bara faxa gbengberenyi ma, kɔnɔ a mu nu na Kora xa mixie ya ma naxee keli Alatala xili ma. A tan faxa a yɛtɛ kan xa yunubi rabaxi nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Munfe ra muxu baba xili bama a xabilɛ xa mixie ya ma, di xɛmɛ to mu na a bɛ? Kɛ nde so muxu fan yi ra, muxu baba ngaxakerenyie tagi!»<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Munsa naxa e xa fe dɛntɛgɛ Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Alatala naxa a masen a bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />«Selofexadi xa di ginɛe bara nɔndi fala. E baba kɛ so e yi ra alɔ e baba ngaxakerenyie a sɔtɔ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, ‹Xa xɛmɛ nde sa faxa di xɛmɛ xanbi, wo a kɛ so a xa di ginɛe yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Xa di ginɛ fan mu na a bɛ, wo a kɛ so a fafaxakerenyie yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Xa fafaxakeren yo mu na a bɛ, wo a so a baba fafaxakerenyie yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Xa a sa li, a baba fafaxakeren yo mu na, wo a kɛ so mixi yi ra, e nun naxan makɔrɛ e boore ra a xabilɛe ya ma.› Na xa findi yaamari nun sɛriyɛ ra Isirayilakae bɛ, alɔ n tan Alatala a yamarixi i bɛ ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosuwe findife Munsa ɲɔxɔɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «Te yi Abarimi geya fari, alako i xa bɔxi mato n naxan fima Isirayilakae ma. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />I na gɛ a matode, i taa masarama nɛ, i gbilen i benbae ma alɔ i taara Haruna, <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />barima wo bara n ma yaamari matandi. Isirayilakae to keli n xili ma ye xɔli xa fe ra Kadesi, Sini gbengberenyi ma, wo mu seedeɲɔxɔya raba n ma sɛniyɛnyi xa fe ra.»<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Munsa naxa a fala Alatala bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />«Alatala, daali birin Marigi Ala, mixi keren dɔxɔ ɲama xun ma, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />naxan tima e ya ra, e mini tɛmui nun e so tɛmui, naxan e raminima, a e raso, alako i xa ɲama naxa lu alɔ xuruse naxee rabɛɲinxi e yɛtɛ ma, kantama yo mu e bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, «I xa Nunu xa di Yosuwe sugandi, Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi na naxan ma. I xa i bɛlɛxɛ sa a ma. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />I xa a ti Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun ɲama birin ya xɔri, i fa yaamarie so a yi ra, <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />i xa mangɛya nde xa dangi a ma, alako Isirayila ɲama birin xa a xui suxu. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />A tima nɛ Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ya i n waxɔnfe maxɔrinde gɛmɛ sugandixie ra. N yaabi naxan fima, a tan nun ɲama birin ɲɛrɛma na nan ma. E minima Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xui nan ma, e soma Yosuwe xui nan ma.» <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Munsa naxa Alatala xa yaamari raba. A naxa Yosuwe tongo, a sa a ti Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun Isirayila ɲama ya i, <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />a a bɛlɛxɛ sa a ma, a yaamarie so a yi ra, alɔ Alatala nu bara a yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Gɛɛsɛgɛ nun nunmare sɛrɛxɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, e xa n ma sɛrɛxɛ ba a ba tɛmui. Donsee nan e ra, naxee ganma, e xiri ɲɔxunmɛ te n na.<verse eid="NUM 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />«A fala e bɛ, ‹Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ wo xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ba Alatala bɛ, yɛxɛɛ firin, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Keren xa ba gɛɛsɛgɛ, boore xa ba nunmare. <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />Wo man xa sansi xɔri dinxi kilo saxan ba sɛrɛxɛ ra naxan namulanxi oliwi ture fanyi litiri keren nun a tagi ra. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Na sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi mɔɔli nu bama n bɛ Turusinina geya ma, a xiri ɲɔxunmɛ nu tema n na. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Wɛni sɛrɛxɛ litiri keren nun a tagi bama yɛxɛɛ sɛɛti ma Alatala bɛ. Na sɛrɛxɛ rafalama yire sɛniyɛnxi nan kui. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Wo xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ ba nunmare tɛmui yɛxɛɛ sɛɛti ma. Na birin findima sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nan na naxan xiri ɲɔxunmɛ tema n tan Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malabu lɔxɔɛ sɛrɛxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />Malabui lɔxɔɛ wo xa yɛxɛɛ firin ba malabu lɔxɔɛ sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ naxan namulanxi ture kilo senni ra, nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ xa ba na yɛxɛɛe sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Malabui lɔxɔɛ sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nan bama gɛɛsɛgɛ nun nunmare sɛrɛxɛe ra, a nun e xa wɛni sɛrɛxɛe.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kike xi singe sɛrɛxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />Kike xi singe birin, wo xa tuura firin ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, a nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, a nun yɛxɛɛ solofere, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo solomanaani naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa tuura keren yo tuura keren sɛɛti ma. Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo senni naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren yo yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo saxan naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ keren yo yɛxɛɛ keren sɛɛti ma. Sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nan a ra naxan ganma, a xiri ɲɔxunmɛ te n tan Alatala ra. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Wɛni litiri saxan sɛrɛxɛ xa ba tuura birin bɛ. Wɛni litiri firin sɛrɛxɛ xa ba yɛxɛɛ kontonyi birin bɛ. Wɛni litiri keren sɛrɛxɛ xa ba yɛxɛɛ birin bɛ. Na sɛrɛxɛ mɔɔli bama kike xi singe birin ɲɛ kui. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, wo gɛɛsɛgɛ nun nunmare sɛrɛxɛ bama tɛmui naxɛ, a nun a xa wɛni sɛrɛxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali sɛrɛxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />Kike singe xi fu nun naani nde, wo xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba Alatala xa binyɛ bun ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Na kike xi fu nun suuli nde findima sali lɔxɔɛ nan na. Wo xa taami lɛbinitare don xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Na xi singe wo xa wo malan Ala batude. Wo naxa wali yo raba na lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Wo xa yi sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie ba Alatala bɛ na lɔxɔɛ: tuura firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ solofere, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo solomanaani naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa tuura keren yo tuura keren sɛɛti ma. Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo senni naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren yo yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo saxan naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ yo yɛxɛɛ sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa gɛɛsɛgɛ daaxie xun ma, naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Wo xa nee ba xi solofere bun ma. Sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nan a ra naxan ganma, a xiri ɲɔxunmɛ te n tan Alatala ra. Nee bama nɛ lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, e nun boore sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie, nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />A xi solofere nde, wo xa wo malan Ala batude. Wo naxa wali gbɛtɛe raba na lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛ Xaba Sali sɛrɛxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />Xɛ Xaba Sali, wo na fa sansi bogi singee sɛrɛxɛ ra Alatala xɔn ma, wo xa wo malan n batude. Wo naxa wali yo suxu na lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Wo xa yi sɛrɛxɛe ba: tuura firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, nun yɛxɛɛ solofere, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ. Nee nan bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, e xiri ɲɔxunmɛ te n tan Alatala ra. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo solomanaani naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa tuura keren yo tuura keren sɛɛti ma. Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo senni naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren yo yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo saxan naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ keren yo yɛxɛɛ keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra. Lanyuru yo naxa lu na sɛrɛxɛe ma.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Sara xa Sali sɛrɛxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />«Kike solofere nde xi singe, wo xa wo malan n batude. Wo naxa wali yo raba na lɔxɔɛ. Wo sarae fema nɛ na lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Wo xa tuura firin ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, a nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, a nun yɛxɛɛ solofere, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo solomanaani naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa tuura keren yo tuura keren sɛɛti ma. Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo senni naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren yo yɛxɛɛe kontonyi keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo saxan naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ keren yo yɛxɛɛ keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Na sɛrɛxɛ birin sama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nan xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, a nun wo naxee bama kike yo kike a xi singe, a nun sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ naxan sama e sɛɛti ma. Sɛrɛxɛe nan e ra naxee ganma, e xiri ɲɔxunmɛ te n tan Alatala ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yunubi xafari lɔxɔɛ sɛrɛxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />«Na kike solofere nde, xi fu lɔxɔɛ, wo xa wo malan n batude, wo fan xa sunyi suxu. Wo naxa wali yo raba na lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Na lɔxɔɛ wo xa tuura nde ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, a nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren, a nun yɛxɛɛ solofere, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo solomanaani naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa tuura sɛɛti ma. Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo senni naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren yo yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo saxan naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa yɛxɛɛ keren yo yɛxɛɛ keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, dangife na yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ, nun na sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie wo naxee bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, a nun sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bage Ti Sali sɛrɛxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />«Kike solofere nde, xi fu nun suuli, wo xa wo malan n batude. Wo naxa wali yo raba na lɔxɔɛ. Wo xa sali nde raba n tan Alatala bɛ xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />A xi singe, wo xa tuura fu nun saxan, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra n tan Alatala bɛ, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. Wo na e gan, a xiri ɲɔxunmɛ te n tan Alatala ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo solomanaani naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa na tuura fu nun saxan sɛɛti ma. Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo senni naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa na yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />Sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛ kilo saxan naxan namulanxi ture ra, a xa sa na yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, dangife na yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ, nun na sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie wo naxee bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, a nun sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />«Sali xi firin nde, wo xa tuura fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru mu na naxan ma, <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />a nun e xa sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />«Sali xi saxan nde, wo xa tuura fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru mu na naxan ma, <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />a nun e xa sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />«Sali xi naani nde, wo xa tuura fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru mu na naxan ma, <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />a nun e xa sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />«Sali xi suuli nde, wo xa tuura fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru mu na naxan ma, <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />a nun e xa sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />«Sali xi senni nde, wo xa tuura fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru mu na naxan ma, <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />a nun e xa sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />«Sali xi solofere nde, wo xa tuura fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru mu na naxan ma, <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />a nun e xa sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />«Sali xi solomasaxan nde, wo xa wo malan n tan Ala batude. Wo naxa wali gbɛtɛe raba na lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Wo xa tuura fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi firin, nun yɛxɛɛ fu nun naani ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, naxee bara ɲɛ keren sɔtɔ, lanyuru mu na naxan ma. E xiri ɲɔxunmɛ tema n tan Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Wo man xa sansi xɔri dinxi nun wɛni sɛrɛxɛ ba naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma na tuura, na yɛxɛɛ kontonyi, nun na yɛxɛɛ xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Wo xa sikɔtɛ keren fan ba n tan Alatala bɛ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe sa boore sɛrɛxɛe xun, wo naxee bama lɔxɔɛ birin, e nun sansi xɔri nun wɛni naxan fan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.»<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />«Sɛrɛxɛe nan na ki wo lan wo xa naxee ba n tan Alatala bɛ wo xa sali lɔxɔɛe, bafe wo xa laayidi sɛrɛxɛe, wo xa sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexie, wo xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie, wo xa sansi xɔri dinxi sɛrɛxɛe, wo xa wɛni sɛrɛxɛe, nun wo xa xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe.»<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Laayidi tongoxi sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Munsa naxa Alatala xa yaamari birin fala Isirayilakae bɛ, a naxee so a yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Munsa naxa yi masenyi ti Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ kuntigie bɛ, «Alatala xa yaamarie nan ya: <verse eid="NUM 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />Xa mixi nde sa laayidi tongo Alatala bɛ fe nde ma, xa na mu a a kali Alatala ra fe nde ma, na kanyi lan nɛ a xa a xui rakamali. A naxan birin falaxi a dɛ ra, a xa a birin naba.»<verse eid="NUM 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />«Ginɛ dimɛdi na sa laayidi tongo fe nde ma Alatala bɛ, a na a baba xɔnyi tɛmui naxɛ, a fa a kali, <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />a baba naxa a kolon a a xa di ginɛ bara laayidi nde tongo, a baba mu sese fala na fe kui, a xa na laayidi rakamali. <verse eid="NUM 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />Kɔnɔ xa a baba mu tin na laayidi tongoxi ra a mɛ tɛmui, a mu lan na ginɛ dimɛdi xa a rakamali. Alatala mu a suxuma a ra a baba waxɔnfe xa fe ra.»<verse eid="NUM 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />«Ginɛ na sa laayidi tongo, xa na mu a a kali wɔyɛnyi mafuraxi ra, <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />xa a xa mɔri sa na mɛ, a fa lu a mu sese fala na fe ra, a xa na laayidi rakamali. <verse eid="NUM 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />Kɔnɔ xa a xa mɔri mu tin na fe ra a mɛ tɛmui, a mu lan na ginɛ xa a rakamali. Alatala mu a suxuma a ra.»<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />«Kaaɲɛ ginɛ na laayidi tongo, xa na mu, ginɛ naxan nun a xa xɛmɛ bara fatan, a xa a xa laayidi rakamali.»<verse eid="NUM 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />«Ginɛ xɛmɛ taa idɔxɔɛ na laayidi tongo, xa na mu a a kali fe nde ma, <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />xa a xa mɔri fa na fe kolon, kɔnɔ a mu fefe fala na fe kui, a lanma na ginɛ xa a xa laayidi rakamali. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />A xa mɔri na a xa laayidi mɛ tɛmui naxɛ, a nɔma tinde a ra, xa na mu a ra, a nɔma tɔnyi dɔxɔde a ma. Alatala mu a suxuma a ra. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />A xa mɔri nɔma tinde, xa na mu a ra tondide a xa laayidi nun a xa kali birin na. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Xa a mu fefe falama na fe kui, a xa ginɛ lanma a xa a xa laayidi rakamali. A xa dundui a niyama nɛ ginɛ xa a xa laayidi rakamali. <verse eid="NUM 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Xa a xa mɔri tɔnyi dɔxɔma a xa ginɛ xa laayidi ma tɛmui gbɛtɛ, a tan nan yati a xa ginɛ xa kote xaninma.»<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 30:17" />«Alatala xa sɛriyɛ nan na ki a naxan fixi Munsa ma, ginɛ xa fe ra naxan na xɛmɛ taa, xa na mu a ra ginɛ naxan na a baba xɔnyi.»<verse eid="NUM 30:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Madiyankae gerefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />«I xa Isirayilakae gbe ɲɔxɔ Madiyankae ma. I na gɛ na ra, i fa taa masara.» <verse eid="NUM 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Munsa naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Xɛmɛ ndee xa geresosee tongo Madiyan xili ma wo gbe ɲɔxɔde Alatala xili ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin xa mixi wulu keren keren ba geresoe ra.»<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firin naxa mixi wulu keren keren ba geresoe ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Munsa naxa na sɔɔri wulu fu nun firin xɛɛ gere tide. Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di xɛmɛ Finexasi naxa e mati, se sɛniyɛnxie nu na a yi ra, a nun sara naxee tɔnxuma fima e boore ma gere xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />E naxa siga gere tide Madiyan xili ma, alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ Munsa bɛ. E naxa na xɛmɛe birin faxa, <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />a nun Madiyan mangɛ suuli: Efi, Rekemi, Suuru, Xuru, nun Reba. E naxa Beyori xa di xɛmɛ Balami fan faxa santidɛgɛma ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />E naxa Madiyan ginɛe nun e xa di birin findi konyie ra. E naxa e xa xurusee, e xa gɔɔrɛe, nun e harige birin tongo. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />E naxa e xa taae nun e xa daaxae gan. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />E naxa e xa harige, e xa xurusee, nun e xa ginɛe suxu, <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />e e xanin Munsa, Eleyasari, nun Isirayila ɲama xɔn ma e yonkinde Mowaba fiili ma, Yurudɛn xure dɛ i, Yeriko ya tagi.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Munsa, Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, nun Isirayila ɲama yareratie naxa e ralan yonkinde fari ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Munsa naxa xɔnɔ sɔɔri wulu xunyie nun sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunyie ma, a a fala e bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />«Munfe ra wo mu yi ginɛe faxa? <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />E tan nan bira Balami xa marasi fɔxɔ ra, e Isirayilakae ramini Alatala xa kira xɔn Peyori, Alatala fa gbaloe ragoro a xa ɲama ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Awa, yakɔsi, wo xɛmɛ dimɛ birin faxa, a nun ginɛ naxee bara xɛmɛ fe kolon. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Ginɛ dimɛdie tan, wo xa nee ragata wo yɛtɛ bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Wo tan naxee bara mixi faxa, xa na mu wo bara din fure ra, wo xa lu yonkinde fari ma xi solofere, a nun mixie wo naxee suxu gere kui. Wo xa wo yɛtɛ nun wo xa mixi suxuxie rasɛniyɛn a xi saxan nde nun a xi solofere nde. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Wo xa wo xa dugie fan nasɛniyɛn a nun see naxan tan birin nafalaxi kiri, si xabe, nun wuri ra.»<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa a fala sɔɔrie bɛ naxee gere tixi, «Alatala xa sɛriyɛ nan ya a naxan masenxi Munsa bɛ: <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Xɛɛma, gbeti, wure gbeeli, wure, yɔxui, nun sunbui, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />se naxan birin mu ganma tɛ ra, wo xa a raso tɛ, a xa sɛniyɛn. Na dangi xanbi wo man xa a rasɛniyɛn ye ra. Se naxan mu nɔma rasode tɛ, wo xa na rasɛniyɛn ye ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Wo xa wo xa dugie xa a xi solofere nde. Na tɛmui wo bara sɛniyɛn, wo fa nɔma sode yonkinde.»<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔtɔse itaxunfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />«I tan, Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, nun Isirayila kuntigie, wo xa yi mixi suxuxie, nun e xa xurusee kɔnti, wo naxee sɔtɔxi gere kui. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />I xa e itaxun sɔɔrie nun ɲama ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Sɔɔrie gbe ya ma, i xa mixi keren tongo mixi kɛmɛ suuli yo mixi kɛmɛ suuli tagi, a xa findi n gbe ra. Xurusee fan na ki, kɛmɛ suuli yo kɛmɛ suuli, i keren nan tongoma e ya ma n bɛ. A findi ningee ra, a findi sofalee ra, a findi xuruse lanmae ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />I xa nee ba sɔɔrie gbe ya ma, i e fi Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ma Alatala xili ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Isirayila ɲama gbe ya ma, i xa mixi keren tongo mixi tongo suuli yo mixi tongo suuli ya ma, kɛmɛ suuli yo kɛmɛ suuli, i keren nan tongoma e ya ma n bɛ. A findi ningee ra, a findi sofalee ra, a findi xuruse lanmae ra. I xa nee so Lewi bɔnsɔɛ yi ra, naxee e ɲɔxɔ saxi n ma hɔrɔmɔlingira xɔn.»<verse eid="NUM 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Munsa nun Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa a raba, alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ Munsa bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Naxan sɔtɔ gere kui, a xasabi lan xuruse lanma wulu kɛmɛ senni wulu tongo solofere nun suuli nan ma, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />ninge wulu tongo solofere nun firin, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />sofale wulu tongo senni nun keren, <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />ginɛ naxee mu xɛmɛ fe kolon, mixi wulu tongo saxan nun firin. <verse eid="NUM 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Sɛɛti naxan fixi sɔɔrie ma naxee gere ti, a xasabi naxa lan xuruse lanma wulu kɛmɛ saxan wulu tongo saxan nun solofere kɛmɛ suuli ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />Alatala gbe naxan ba na ra, na naxa lan xuruse lanma kɛmɛ senni tongo solofere nun suuli ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Ninge naxee fixi sɔɔrie ma, e xasabi naxa lan wulu tongo saxan nun senni ma. Alatala gbe naxan ba na ra, na naxa lan ninge tongo solofere nun firin ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Sofale naxee fixi sɔɔrie ma, e xasabi naxa lan wulu tongo saxan kɛmɛ suuli ma. Alatala gbe naxan ba na ra, na naxa lan sofale tongo senni nun keren ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Mixi naxee fixi sɔɔrie ma, e xasabi naxa lan wulu fu nun senni ma. Alatala gbe naxan ba na ra, na naxa lan mixi tongo saxan nun firin ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Munsa naxa Alatala gbe fi Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ma, alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Isirayila ɲama gbe, Munsa naxan so e yi ra, naxan mu nu na sɔɔrie gbe ya ma, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />na findixi xuruse lanmae wulu kɛmɛ saxan tongo saxan nun solofere kɛmɛ suuli nan ma, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />a nun ninge wulu tongo saxan nun senni, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />a nun sofale wulu tongo saxan kɛmɛ suuli, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />a nun mixi wulu fu nun senni. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Na kui, xurusee ba, mixie ba, tongo suuli yo tongo suuli, Munsa naxa keren keren ba a birin na, a e so Lewi bɔnsɔɛ yi ra, naxee e ɲɔxɔ saxi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira xɔn, alɔ Alatala a yamari a bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tantui hadiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunyie nun sɔɔri wulu xunyie naxa fa Munsa yire, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />e a fala a bɛ, «Muxu tan i xa konyie, muxu bara sɔɔrie kɔnti naxee nu na muxu xa yaamari bun ma. E birin na na. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Na nan a toxi muxu bara fa hadiyae ra Alatala bɛ xunsare xa fe ra. Kankan bara fa a sɔtɔsee ra alɔ bɛlɛxɛrasoe, xurundɛe, tulirasoe, nun kɔnmagore xɛɛma daaxi.»<verse eid="NUM 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Munsa nun Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa na see xɛɛma daaxi rasuxu e yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Na xɛɛma birin, sɔɔri xunyie fa naxan na Alatala bɛ, a xasabi lan fayida xɛɛma kilo kɛmɛ tongo solofere nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Sɔɔrie tan nu e gbee ragataxi e yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Munsa nun Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa na see birin nasuxu sɔɔri wulu xunyie nun sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunyie yi ra, e a xanin hɔrɔmɔlingira yire, alako na xa findi tɔnxuma ra Isirayila xa fe ra Alatala bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Bɔnsɔɛ saxan dɔxɔfe Yurudɛn xure sogetede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Gɔɔrɛ gbegbe nan nu na Ruben bɔnsɔɛ nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ yi ra. E to a to Yaasɛri nun Galadi bɔxi fan xurusee bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />e naxa fa Munsa, Eleyasari, nun Isirayila kuntigie yire, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />e a fala e bɛ, «Taa naxee xili Ataroti, Dibon, Yaasɛri, Nimira, Xɛsibɔn, Eleyale, Sebami, Nebo, nun Beyon, nee na bɔxi ya ma, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />Alatala naxan saxi Isirayila ɲama sagoe. Na longori fan xuruse kanyie bɛ alɔ muxu tan. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Xa wo bara tin a ra, be xa findi muxu tan gbe ra, hali muxu mu dangi Yurudɛn naakiri ma.»<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Munsa naxa Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nun Ruben bɔnsɔɛ yaabi, «Wo ngaxakerenyie sigama nɛ gere sode, wo tan xa lu be? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Munfe ra wo wama limaniya bafe wo ngaxakerenyie yi ra, alako e naxa dangi Yurudɛn naakiri ma bɔxi ma Alatala naxan fixi e ma? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Wo babae fan bara na wali mɔɔli raba n to e xɛɛ Kanaan bɔxi rabɛnde kelife Kadesi Barineya. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />E to gɛ Esekoli gulunba rabɛnde, e naxa gbilen, e fa limaniya ba Isirayilakae yi ra sofe ra bɔxi ma, Alatala naxan fixi e ma. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Alatala naxa xɔnɔ Isirayilakae ma na lɔxɔɛ, a fa a kali, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‹Yi mixi naxan birin kelixi Misira, naxan xa simaya bara dangi ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, e mu soma bɔxi ma n nan n kali Iburahima, Isiyaga nun Yaxuba bɛ dɛnnaxan fife ra e ma, barima e mu bira n fɔxɔ ra e ɲanige birin na. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Fo Yefune xa di xɛmɛ Kalebi Kenisika, nun Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe, nee nan peti bira n xui fɔxɔ ra e ɲanige birin na.› <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Alatala naxa xɔnɔ Isirayilakae ma ki fanyi, a fa e rabɛɲin gbengberenyi ma ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma, han na mixi birin faxa, naxee wali ki mu nu rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />Wo tan yunubitɔɛ bɔnsɔɛe, wo na birafe wo benbae fɔxɔ ra Alatala raxɔnɔfe ra Isirayila xili ma. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Xa wo keli Ala xa kira xɔn, a man Isirayila rabɛɲinma nɛ gbengberenyi ma, e halaki wo xa fe ra.»<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />E naxa siga Munsa yire, e a fala a bɛ, «Muxu wama gɔɔrɛ tife be muxu xa xurusee bɛ, a nun muxu wama yiree yailanfe be muxu xa ginɛe nun muxu xa die luma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Kɔnɔ muxu bara tin sɔɔriɲa rabade muxu ngaxakerenyi Isirayilakae bɛ han e xa so e sode. Muxu xa die tan luma be muxu xanbi ra nɛ taa kantaxie kui, alako bekae naxa e tɔɔrɔ. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Muxu mu gbilenma muxu xɔnyi be, fo Isirayilaka birin a gbe bɔxi masɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Kɛ gbɛtɛ mu luma muxu tan bɛ sɔnɔn Yurudɛn naakiri ma. Muxu gbe na bebiri Yurudɛn sogetede nɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Munsa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Xa wo sa a raba alɔ wo a falaxi ki naxɛ, xa wo wo maxiri sigafe ra gere tide Alatala xili ra, <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />xa wo mu gbilen be Yurudɛn naakiri ma, han Alatala gɛ a yaxuie birin keride a ya ra, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />na tɛmui be bara findi wo xa bɔxi ra Alatala xili ra. Mɛnni na lu Alatala xa yaamari bun ma, wo nɔma gbilende be. Na kui wo bara wo xa laayidi rakamali Isirayila nun Alatala bɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />«Kɔnɔ xa wo mu sa na sɛriyɛ rabatu, na bara findi yunubi ra wo bɛ, wo na sare fima nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Yakɔsi, wo xa taae ti wo xa ginɛe nun wo xa die bɛ. Wo xa gɔɔrɛe yailan wo xa xurusee fan bɛ. Kɔnɔ wo naxa nɛɛmu wo xa laayidi tongoxi ma de, wo xa na rakamali.» <verse eid="NUM 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nun Ruben bɔnsɔɛ naxa Munsa yaabi, «Muxu fama nɛ i xa yaamari birin suxude. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Muxu xa die, muxu xa ginɛe, nun muxu xa xurusee birin luma be Galadi bɔxi ma, <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />kɔnɔ muxu geresosee tongoma nɛ, muxu fa gere so Alatala bɛ alɔ i a yitaxi ki naxɛ, muxu marigi.»<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Munsa naxa Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe, a nun Isirayila kuntigie yamari, <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />«Xa Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nun Ruben bɔnsɔɛ sa dangi Yurudɛn naakiri ma, e siga gere sode Alatala bɛ, han wo naxa na bɔxi birin masɔtɔ tɛmui naxɛ, wo xa Galadi bɔxi so e yi ra kɛ ra. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Kɔnɔ xa e mu na raba, e fan xa sabati wo tagi Kanaan bɔxi ma!» <verse eid="NUM 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nun Ruben bɔnsɔɛ naxa e yaabi, «Alatala naxan birin masenxi a xa konyi die xa fe ra, muxu a birin nabama nɛ. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Muxu dangima nɛ Yurudɛn naakiri ma muxu xa geresosee ra sigafe ra Kanaan bɔxi ma Alatala ya tode ra, kɔnɔ muxu kɛ tan findima bɔxi nan na Yurudɛn bebiri sɛɛti ma.»<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Munsa naxa Amorikae xa mangɛ Sixɔn nun Basan mangɛ Ogo xa bɔxi nun na rabilinyi fi Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, nun Yusufu xa di xɛmɛ Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren ma.<verse eid="NUM 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Gadi xa die naxa gbilen Dibon ti ra, a nun Ataroti, Aroweri, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />Atiroti Sofana, Yaasɛri, Yogbeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />Beti Nimira, nun Beti Xarani. E bara findi taa makantaxie ra, gɔɔrɛe gbegbe fan nu na.<verse eid="NUM 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ naxa gbilen Xɛsibɔn ti ra, a nun Eleyale, Kiriyatayimi, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />Nebo, Baali Meyoni, nun Sibima. E naxa na taa ndee xilie masara.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Manasi xa di Makiri xa die to Galadi taa suxu, e Amorikae keri naxee nu sabatixi naa, <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Munsa naxa na taa so e yi ra sabatide ra. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Manasi xa Yayiri fan naxa taa ndee suxu, a e xili Yayiri xa taae. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Noba fan naxa Kenata taa nun a rabilinyi suxu, a yɛtɛ xili sa e xun ma.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa biyaasi kelife Misira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Ɲɛrɛ nan ya Isirayilakae naxan naba e xundɛ ki ma Munsa nun Haruna xa yaamari bun ma e to keli Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Munsa na birin sɛbɛxi nɛ alɔ Alatala a yamari a bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />E naxa keli Ramesesi taa Misira bɔxi kike singe xi fu nun suuli. Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali lɔxɔɛ, na kuye iba Isirayilakae naxa mini Misira xɔrɛya kui Misiraka birin ya xɔri. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />A a lixi na tɛmui, Misirakae nu na e xa di singee ragatafe, Alatala naxee faxa e ya ma a xa xɔnɛ kui e xa kuyee xa fe ra.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Isirayilakae naxa keli Ramesesi, e sa yonkin Sukɔti.<verse eid="NUM 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Etama gbengberenyi dɛ ra.<verse eid="NUM 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />E to keli Etama, e naxa gbilen Pi Haxirɔti mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:7">Baali Sefon ya tagi, e sa yonkin Migidoli ya ra.<verse eid="NUM 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa baa igiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:8">e siga gbengberenyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:8">E naxa xi saxan ɲɛrɛ raba Etama gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:8">e sa yonkin Mara.<verse eid="NUM 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Elimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:9">e dulonyi fu nun firin nun tugi tongo solofere li dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Xulunyumi Baa sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Sini gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa sa yonkin Dofika.<verse eid="NUM 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Alusu.<verse eid="NUM 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Refidimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:14">kɔnɔ e mu ye to naa.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Turusinina gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Kibiroti Hataawa.<verse eid="NUM 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Xaseroti.<verse eid="NUM 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Ritima.<verse eid="NUM 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Rimɔn Peresi.<verse eid="NUM 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Libina.<verse eid="NUM 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Risa.<verse eid="NUM 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Kehelata.<verse eid="NUM 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Seeferi geya ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Xarada.<verse eid="NUM 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Makeloti.<verse eid="NUM 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Taxati.<verse eid="NUM 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Tera.<verse eid="NUM 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Mitika.<verse eid="NUM 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Xasamona.<verse eid="NUM 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Mosera.<verse eid="NUM 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Beneyaakan.<verse eid="NUM 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Horo Gidigada.<verse eid="NUM 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Yotobata.<verse eid="NUM 33:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Abarona.<verse eid="NUM 33:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Esiyon Geberi.<verse eid="NUM 33:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Kadesi Sini gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />E keli mɛnni nɛ, e naxa siga Horo geya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:37">Edon bɔxi naaninyi fɛ ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Isirayilakae xa mini Misira ɲɛ tongo naani kike suuli nde xi singe, Alatala naxa Haruna yamari a xa te Horo geya fari, a xa laaxira mɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Haruna nu bara ɲɛ kɛmɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan sɔtɔ, a faxa tɛmui Horo geya fari.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Aradi mangɛ, naxan sabatixi Negewi gbengberenyi Kanaan bɔxi ma, a naxa a kolon Isirayilakae bara fa.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Isirayilakae to keli Horo geya yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:41">e naxa sa yonkin Salamona.<verse eid="NUM 33:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Punon.<verse eid="NUM 33:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Oboti.<verse eid="NUM 33:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Iye Abarimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:44">Mowaba bɔxi naaninyi ra.<verse eid="NUM 33:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Dibon Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 33:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Alamɔn Dibilatayima.<verse eid="NUM 33:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Abarimi geyae yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:47">Nebo geya yatagi.<verse eid="NUM 33:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa siga Mowaba fiili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:48">Yurudɛn xure dɛ ra, Yeriko taa yatagi.<verse eid="NUM 33:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />E naxa yonkin Yurudɛn xure dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 33:49">Beti Yesimoti nun Abeli Sitimi longori Mowaba fiili ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanaan bɔxi itaxunfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ Mowaba fiili ma, Yurudɛn xure dɛ ra, Yeriko taa yatagi, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, ‹Wo na Yurudɛn xure giri tɛmui naxɛ sofe ra Kanaan bɔxi ma, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />wo mɛnnikae birin faxa. Wo xa e xa kuye birin kana, naxee masolixi gɛmɛ ra, naxee yailanxi wure raxunuxi ra. Wo xa e xa batudee fan kana. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Wo xa na bɔxi suxu, wo fa sabati naa. N bara na bɔxi fi wo ma. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Na bɔxi itaxunma wo ma Alatala xa maragiri kɛɲa nan ma a xabilɛ ki ma. Naxee bɔnsɔɛ xa mixie na wuya, e xa bɔxi belebele sɔtɔ. Naxee bɔnsɔɛ xa mixie mu wuya, e xa bɔxi xa xurun. Alatala a ragirima kankan naxan sɔtɔma a bɔnsɔɛ ki ma. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Kɔnɔ xa wo mu mɛnnikae faxa, e fama maniyade ɲooge nan na naxan mixi ya tɔɔrɔma, xa na mu a ra tunbee naxee mixi fari masɔxɔma. E findima nɛ wo yaxuie ra wo xɔnyi. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Na tɛmui, n e xa yunubi sare dɔxɔma wo tan nan ma.›»<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila bɔxi naaninyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />«A masen Isirayilakae bɛ, ‹Wo na siga Kanaan bɔxi ma, n naxan fixi wo ma kɛ ra, a naaninyie nan yi ki: <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />Yirefanyi mabiri, wo xa bɔxi naaninyi sa fɔlɔma Sini gbengberenyi nan ma, Edon bɔxi mabiri. Na naaninyi sa fɔlɔma Fɔxɔɛ Baa nan ma sogetede mabiri, <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />a sa a kɔnkɔrɔn Tali Tede yirefanyi mabiri, a a xun sa Sini, a dangi Kadesi Barineya yirefanyi mabiri, a siga Xasari Adari mabiri, a sa Asimon li. <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />A sa keli Asimon, a a kɔnkɔrɔn han Misira dabonyi kui, a fa sa mini Baa Xungbe ma.›»<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />«A sogegorode naaninyi findima Baa Xungbe nan na.»<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />«A kɔɔla naaninyi sa fɔlɔma Baa Xungbe nan ma, han a fa dɔxɔ Horo geya ra. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Kelife ra Horo geya ma, wo xa naaninyi sigama na ki nɛ han Xamata sode dɛ ra, a sa dɔxɔ Sedade ra. <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />A na keli mɛnni, a sigama Sifiron mabiri nɛ han a sa mini Xasari Enan ma. Wo xa bɔxi naaninyi nan na ki kɔɔla mabiri.»<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />«A sogetede, wo xa naaninyi sa kelima Xasari Enan nan ma, a siga han Seefami. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />A keli mɛnni, a siga Ribila, Ayin sogetede biri, a man siga, a sa din tentenyie ra Kinereti baa sogetede biri ra, <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />a sa mini Yurudɛn xure ma, a fa sa a raɲɔn Fɔxɔɛ Baa ma. Wo xa bɔxi naaninyie nan na ki.»<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Munsa naxa na yaamari radangi Isirayilakae ma, a falafe ra, «Bɔxi nan yi ki, naxan itaxunma Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ solomanaani nun a tagi ma, alɔ Alatala a ragirixi kankan ma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti bara e gbe kɛ sɔtɔ e denbaya ki ma, <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Yurudɛn naakiri ma, Yeriko ya tagi sogetede biri ra.»<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />«Eleyasari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe nan yi bɔxi itaxunma. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Wo xa yarerati keren keren sugandi bɔnsɔɛ birin kui, naxee lanma yi bɔxi itaxunyi.<verse eid="NUM 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />E xilie nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 34:19">Yuda bɔnsɔɛ, Yefune xa di xɛmɛ Kalebi.<verse eid="NUM 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ, Amixudi xa di xɛmɛ Semuweli.<verse eid="NUM 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ, Kisilon xa di xɛmɛ Elidada<verse eid="NUM 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Dana bɔnsɔɛ, Yogoli xa di xɛmɛ Buuki.<verse eid="NUM 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Yusufu xa di Manasi bɔnsɔɛ, Efodo xa di xɛmɛ Xaniyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ, Sifitan xa di xɛmɛ Kemuweli.<verse eid="NUM 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ, Paranaki xa di xɛmɛ Elisafan.<verse eid="NUM 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Isakari bɔnsɔɛ, Asana xa di xɛmɛ Palatiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Aseri bɔnsɔɛ, Selomi xa di xɛmɛ Axihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ, Amixudi xa di xɛmɛ Pedaheli.»<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Alatala nee nan sugandi Kanaan bɔxi itaxunfe ra Isirayilakae ma.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa taae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, Mowaba fiili ma, Yurudɛn xure fɛ ma, Yeriko ya tagi, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, e xa taa ndee nun e rabilinyie sugandi e xa bɔxi kui, e naxee fima Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma, e sabatima dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ sabatima na taae nan kui, e xa xurusee luma na rabilinyie. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Na taa rabilinyie xa gboya sigama nɛ han nɔngɔn wulu keren na taa sɛɛti naani birin ma, <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />kelife taa tɛtɛ ma sigafe nɔngɔn wulu firin a sogetede biri, a sogegorode biri, a kɔɔla ma, nun a yirefanyi ma.»<verse eid="NUM 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />«Na taa tongo naani nun solomasaxan ya ma, wo xa taa senni sugandi naxee findima makantadee ra mixie bɛ naxee bara faxɛ ti e mu a ɲanigexi. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Wo xa na taa tongo naani nun solomasaxan nun e rabilinyie fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Bɔnsɔɛ naxee xa taae wuya, e xa taa gbegbe fi. Bɔnsɔɛ naxee xa taae mu wuya, e xa taa dondoronti fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma.»<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Alatala naxa a masen Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ, e na Yurudɛn xure igiri sofe ra Kanaan bɔxi ma, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />e xa taae sugandi, naxee findima makantadee ra mixie bɛ naxee bara faxɛ ti e mu a ɲanigexi. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Na taae nan findima makantadee ra na mixie bɛ, han kiitisae e makiitima tɛmui naxɛ. Na kui e xa ratanga mixie ma naxee wama e gbeɲɔxɔfe, naxee wama e faxafe keren na. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Wo xa taa senni sugandi na wali xa fe ra, <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />saxan Yurudɛn naakiri ma, saxan Kanaan bɔxi ma. Na taae nan findima wo makantadee ra. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Mixi yo mixi, a findi Isirayilaka ra, a findi xɔɲɛ ra, a findi dangi mixi ra, xa naxan yo sa mixi nde faxa a mu a ɲanigexi, na kanyi nɔma a nii ratangade na taa sennie nde kui.»<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />«Kɔnɔ xa mixi sa mixi bɔnbɔ wure ra han a faxa, nii ba nan a ra. A lan nɛ, a fan xa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Xa mixi sa mixi bɔnbɔ gɛmɛ nan na han a faxa, nii ba nan a ra. A lan nɛ, a fan xa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Xa mixi sa mixi bɔnbɔ wuri nan na han a faxa, nii ba nan a ra. A lan nɛ, a fan xa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Gbeɲɔxɔɛ xa na faxɛti faxa a a suxuxi tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />Xa mixi nde sa a boore radin yɛ maraɲaaxui ma, xa na mu, a ɲanige a xa a gɔnɔ se nde ra, a faxa, faxɛti nan a ra. <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />Xa mixi nde sa a boore din a bɛlɛxɛ ra yaxuya ra, a faxa, faxɛti nan a ra. A lan nɛ, a fan xa faxa. Gbeɲɔxɔɛ xa na faxɛti faxa a a suxuxi tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />«Kɔnɔ xa mixi nde sa a boore radin yɛ ɲanigetareɲa kui, xɔnɛ mu na, xa na mu a se nde woli a ma ɲanigetareɲa kui, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />xa na mu a a gɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra ɲanigetareɲa kui, a fa faxa, kɔnɔ xɔnɛ nun yaxuya mu na a kui, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />ɲama xa a makiiti yi sɛriyɛ ra gbeɲɔxɔɛ xa fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Ɲama xa a ba gbeɲɔxɔɛ yi ra, a a raso makantade kui. A xa lu mɛnni han sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi laaxirama tɛmui naxɛ, Alatala naxan sugandixi. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Kɔnɔ xa na kanyi sa mini makantade fari ma, a nu bara so dɛnnaxɛ, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />gbeɲɔxɔɛ fa a to, a faxa, gbeɲɔxɔɛ mu findima faxɛti ra. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Mixi naxan nii bama ɲanigetareɲa kui, a xa lu makantade han sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi laaxirama tɛmui naxɛ. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi na laaxira tɛmui naxɛ, mixi naxan nii baxi ɲanigetareɲa kui, a nɔma gbilende a xɔnyi maratange kui.»<verse eid="NUM 35:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />«Sɛriyɛ nan ya wo bɔnsɔɛ bɛ yire birin, tɛmui birin. <verse eid="NUM 35:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />Faxɛti mu lan a xa faxa seede keren xui ma, fo seede wuyaxi. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Faxɛti mu lan a xun xa sara, a xa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Mixi naxan faxɛ ti ɲanigetareɲa kui, a mu lan a xun xa sara alako a xa gbilen a xɔnyi beenun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi laaxirama tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Wo mu lan wo xa bɔxi findi bɔxi sɛniyɛntare ra. Wuli raminife na nan nabama. Faxɛti wuli gbansan nan findima bɔxi xunsare ra. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Wo naxa wo xɔnyi findi yire sɛniyɛntare ra. N tan Alatala sabatixi wo tan Isirayilakae ya ma.»<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ kɛ kanyi futife sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Denbaya xunyi naxee nu na Galadi xabilɛ ya ma, Makiri xa die, Manasi xa mamadie, Yusufu xabilɛe, nee naxa siga Munsa nun Isirayila denbaya xunyie yire. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />E naxa a fala Munsa bɛ, «Alatala bara a yamari i tan n marigi, i xa yi bɔxi itaxun Isirayila die ma Alatala xa maragiri kɛɲa ma, a xa findi e kɛ ra. Alatala man bara i yamari i xa muxu taara Selofexadi xa harige so a xa di ginɛe yi ra. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Kɔnɔ xa na di ginɛe sa dɔxɔ bɔnsɔɛ gbɛtɛ xɛmɛe xɔn, e kɛ bama nɛ muxu bɔnsɔɛ kɛ ra, a sa e xa xɛmɛe bɔnsɔɛe kɛ xun ma. Na kui nde bama nɛ muxu kɛ ra, naxan fixi muxu bɔnsɔɛ ma maragiri kui. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Xɔrɛya Ɲɛ na a li, e kɛ bama nɛ muxu benbae kɛ ra, a sa e xa xɛmɛe benbae kɛ xun ma.»<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Munsa naxa Alatala xa yaamari radangi Isirayilakae ma, a falafe ra, <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />«Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ, wo nɔndi. Alatala xa yaamari nan ya Selofexadi xa di ginɛe bɛ. E xa dɔxɔ xɛmɛ xɔn naxan na xabilɛ nde kui e baba bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Sese mu bama Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ nde kɛ ra, a findi bɔnsɔɛ gbɛtɛ kɛ ra. Birin a benba kɛ nan xun makantama. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Di ginɛ kɛ kanyi xa dɔxɔ xɛmɛ xɔn naxan na xabilɛ nde kui a baba bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Sese mu bama Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ nde kɛ ra, a findi bɔnsɔɛ gbɛtɛ kɛ ra. Birin a benba kɛ nan xun makantama.»<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Selofexadi xa di ginɛe naxa Alatala xa yaamari suxu alɔ Munsa a fala ki naxɛ. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />E xilie nan ya: Maxala, Tirisa, Xogala, Milika, nun Nowa. E birin naxa dɔxɔ e dɛɛxɔe xɔn ma. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />E dɔxɔ Manasi xa di xabilɛe nan xɔn ma. Na kui e kɛ naxa lu e benba Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Alatala xa sɛriyɛ nun yaamarie nan na ki a naxee fixi Munsa ma, katarabi Isirayila ma, e nu na Mowaba fiili ma tɛmui naxɛ, Yurudɛn xure fɛ ma, Yeriko ya tagi.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>